window.SPECS_TR=window.SPECS_TR||{};window.SPECS_TR.ht={"carpetas":{"framing":"Framing","insulacion":"Izolasyon","drywall":"Enstalasyon drywall","finishing":"Finisyon","pintura":"Penti","fire2h":"Miray fire rated 2 h"},"docs":{"01_092216_Framing_Metalico_No_Estructural.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 22 16 – FRAMING METAL KI PA ESTRIKTIRÈL (NON-STRUCTURAL METAL FRAMING)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 22 16 – FRAMING METAL KI PA ESTRIKTIRÈL (NON-STRUCTURAL METAL FRAMING)\n========================\nSous: Manual V1, paj PDF 745-754 (sèl vèsyon; li pa parèt nan Addendum 2, Addendum 3 ni nan RFI yo te revize yo).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nFabrikan ak mak yo retire espre (gade PDF la).\n\n1. ESPAS TRAVAY: framing pou miray separasyon anndan ki pa estriktirèl, sispansyon plafon an plak ak sistèm grid. Ki gen rapò: 054000 (framing estriktirèl ki fòme a frèt).\n2. KONSEPSYON DELEGE: se yon enjenyè pwofesyonèl ki responsab pou separasyon ki pa estanda ak pou ouvèti ki plis pase 4 ft.\n3. KRITÈ DEFLEKSYON\n   - Miray anndan: L/240 ak chaj lateral 5 psf.\n   - Kanal HVAC (shafts) ak kanal asansè: 10 psf.\n   - Miray deyò: dapre plan estriktirèl yo.\n   - Ak finisyon rijid (pa egzanp mozayik): L/360.\n   - Plafon: L/240 a 5 psf; ak finisyon rijid L/360; chanm vapè (steam room) L/360 a 7.5 psf.\n4. MATERYÈL\n   - Nòm: ASTM C754 (enstalasyon) ak C645 (eleman). Galvanize G40; G90 nan chanm vapè.\n   - Studs ak track: epesè minimòm 0.0179\"; studs ak relief/knurled minimòm 0.0147\"; pwofondè dapre plan yo.\n   - Jwen anwo (head joints) ki pèmèt defleksyon, opsyon:\n       · sistèm klip ki pèmèt mouvman vètikal (pa gen dimansyon ki espesifye);\n       · runner senp ak janm long ak zèl 2\" epi bridging nan 12\" anwo a;\n       · runner doub (runner anndan ak zèl 2\");\n       · track defleksyon.\n   - Track firestop (kont dife) nan miray ki gen rating.\n   - Sele pou track:\n       · Sele kont dife (UL 2079): mouvman ±50 %; FS 10 / SD 20; Klas 0 (G21); VOC 0.18.\n       · Sele kont lafimen/akoustik: mouvman ±50 %; FS 5 / SD 40; VOC 0.20.\n   - Bann metal (strap) 0.0329\". Bridging an kanal laminen a frèt (CRC) 0.0538\" ak zèl 1/2\"; ang klip 1-1/2\" x 0.068\".\n   - Kanal chapo (hat channel) 0.0179\"; kanal rezilyan 1/2\"; furring CRC 0.053\"; sipò (brackets) 0.0329\".\n   - Fil pou mare 0.062\" (oswa doub 0.048\"). Furring Z 1-1/4\" / 7/8\", 0.0179\".\n   - Sispansyon plafon: pandye an fil 0.16\"; pandye plat 1\" x 3/16\"; kanal pòtè (carrying channels) 0.0538\";\n     furring CRC 3/4\" a 0.0538\"; hat channel 7/8\"; ankraj dapre ICC AC193/AC70; sistèm grid.\n   - Jwen an kim izolan 1/8\".\n5. EGZEKISYON\n   - Plak dekalaj (offset plates) a ≤ 24\" o.c. anvan fireproofing yo flite a (SFRM).\n   - Enstale dapre ASTM C754 ak C840/C1063. Blocking ak kontrevantman; pa fè pon sou jwen ekspansyon bilding nan.\n   - ESPAS ANT STUDS: maksimòm 16\" o.c. pou plak yon kouch, plizyè kouch, baz pou mozayik, chanm vapè ak finisyon rijid;\n     finisyon espesyal dapre fabrikan an.\n   - Bann izolan sou miray masonri deyò. Zèl tout studs yo vire nan menm direksyon.\n   - Framing tout wotè rive jis nan estrikti a, ak jwen glisan.\n   - Pòt: 2 studs pou chak chanbrann; cripples ak jwèt 1/2\"; studs chanbrann ankre nan estrikti a.\n   - Separasyon ki gen rating kontinye jis nan estrikti a, ak track ak sele kont dife; sele akoustik kote yo endike.\n   - Miray koube: studs a 6\" o.c. nan pati dwat yo nan de bout ak la.\n   - Furring sou beton a 24\" o.c.; furring Z a 24\" o.c., ak yon dezyèm Z nan 12\" kwen anndan yo.\n   - BLOCKING (bwa ki reziste dife oswa fèy metal) pou: ouvèti ki gen kad, kabinè, aparèy plonbri,\n     separasyon twalèt, ba sipò, akseswa twalèt, kenkayri pòt ak ekipman odyovizyèl.\n   - Pòtay chanbrann asansè. Bann 0.0312\" pou ranp/ba sipò. Tolerans 1/8\".\n   - Sispansyon plafon: pandye a 48\" o.c., kanal pòtè a 48\" o.c., furring a 16\" o.c.\n     Pa pandye nan do kay la, kofraj, zòrèy steel deck ni nan kanal/tiyo. Nan asanblaj ki gen rating, mare ak fil.\n     Nivo nan 1/8\" sou 12 ft.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"02_054000_Framing_Acero_Formado_en_Frio.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 05 40 00 – FRAMING AN ASYE KI FÒME A FRÈT (COLD-FORMED METAL FRAMING)","texto":"SEKSYON 05 40 00 – FRAMING AN ASYE KI FÒME A FRÈT (COLD-FORMED METAL FRAMING)\n========================\nVèsyon ki an vigè: Addendum 3, paj PDF 169-181 (tèks la menm ak sa ki nan Manual V1, paj 282-294).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nMak yo retire.\n\n1. ESPAS TRAVAY (Rezime): miray ki pote chaj; miray deyò ki pa pote chaj; miray anndan ki pa pote chaj andeyò limit 092216 la;\n   joists planche; rafters (twati); joists plafon; sofit.\n2. DOKIMAN POU REMÈT: shop drawings, konsepsyon delege (enjenyè) ak sètifika.\n3. KALITE: fabrikan ki manm SFIA epi ki gen sètifikasyon ICC AC98; soudi dapre AWS D1.1/D1.3.\n4. PÈFÒMANS\n   - Defleksyon: miray deyò L/240; miray anndan L/240 a 5 psf; joists plafon L/240.\n   - Mouvman: diferans tanperati 120 °F; mouvman vètikal ±3/4\". Miray deyò yo konsevwa san kontribisyon sheathing la.\n   - Nòm konsepsyon AISI S100 ak S240; rating UL kote sa aplike.\n5. MATERYÈL\n   - Asye ASTM A1003 Tip H, kouvèti G60 (oswa CP60); klip G90.\n   - Studs ak track deyò: epesè 0.0428\", zèl minimòm 1-5/8\".\n   - Klip bypass; track janm fon ak fant; track defleksyon senp/doub 0.0428\".\n     Zèl track la parèt kòm \"Insert dimension…\" (tèks ki pa t edite nan sous la).\n   - Studs anndan: 0.0428\", zèl 1-5/8\". Track anndan: menm epesè ak stud la, zèl 1-1/4\". Track defleksyon ak klip derive (drift clips).\n   - Joists plafon ak sofit: 0.0428\", zèl 1-5/8\".\n   - Fiksasyon: lank ASTM F1554 Gr. 36; lank ki enstale apre ICC AC01/AC193; fiksasyon ak poud AC70; vis ASTM C1513.\n   - Reparasyon galvanizasyon ASTM A780. Grout 1:2.5. Kal (shims); jwen neyoprèn 1/4\".\n6. FABRIKASYON: vis ak omwen 3 fil ki parèt; li entèdi koupe ak chalimo epi mare ak fil.\n   Tolerans: 1/8\" sou 10 ft; espas ±1/8\"; ekè nan 1/8\"; panno nan 1/16\".\n7. EGZEKISYON\n   - Kale oswa mete grout kote espas la > 1/4\"; enstale dapre ASTM C1007 / AISI S240.\n   - Izole kavite ki pap ka rive ladan yo ankò; plak ranfò nan pèsaj yo.\n   - ESPAS ANT STUDS: \"As indicated on Drawings\" (dapre plan yo; li pa bay yon valè).\n   - Bridging a ≤ 48\" vètikalman; bridging anwo nan 12\" yon track defleksyon senp.\n   - Joists: apui minimòm 1-1/2\"; pa plis pase 2\" de miray yo.\n   - Tès soudi pa pwopriyetè a.\nNòt: Pati 2 pa gen atik pwodwi pou miray ki pote chaj, joists planche ni rafters, byenke Rezime a mete yo ladan (gade FALTANTES.txt).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"03_092116.23_Shaft_Wall_Framing.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 21 16.23 – SHAFT WALL AN PLAK JIPS: FRAMING","texto":"SEKSYON 09 21 16.23 – SHAFT WALL AN PLAK JIPS: FRAMING\n========================\nSous: Manual V1, paj PDF 739-744 (sèl vèsyon). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nMak yo retire.\n\n- Dokiman pou remèt: rapò evalyasyon ICC-ES sistèm yo.\n- Rating: ASTM E119 (dife); akoustik E90/E413.\n- STUDS: pwofil estanda sistèm nan, epesè minimòm 0.018\". J-RUNNER ak janm long omwen 2\" ak menm epesè ak studs yo.\n- TRACK FIRESTOP \"at head of shaft wall on each floor level\" (anwo shaft wall la nan chak nivo).\n- ASANSÈ: pòtay chanbrann an J (J-jamb strut) ak janm 3\" ak epesè minimòm 0.033\".\n- Fas: shaftliner 1\" bò kanal la (Tip X ki reziste imidite oswa ekspozisyon pwolonje); plak bò chanm nan dapre 092900.\n- Framing ASTM C645, galvanize G40. Vis ASTM C1002.\n- Ankraj ak kapasite 5 fwa chaj la (ASTM E488); fiksasyon ak poud ak 10 fwa chaj la (ASTM E1190).\n- Silikòn akoustik 079219 ak SAB (izolasyon akoustik).\nEGZEKISYON\n- Kowòdone ak fireproofing yo flite a (SFRM).\n- Enstale dapre ASTM C754 \"other than stud-spacing requirements\" (eksepte egzijans espas studs yo, se sistèm nan ki bay yo).\n  Fèy A8.1, nòt 1, endike studs shaft wall a 24\" o.c. sof si yo endike lòt bagay.\n- Pa fè pon sou jwen ekspansyon. Framing anplis kote li nesesè. Pòtay chanbrann asansè.\n- Bann 0.033\" pou ranp. Pèsaj yo dwe kenbe rating la.\n- Izole perimèt la; track firestop; jwen kontwòl dapre C840; sele akoustik.\n- Cant panels sou pati ki depase plis pase 4\": plak 1/2\" oswa 5/8\", ang ≥ 75°, vis a 24\" o.c., framing a 24\" o.c.\n- Tolerans 1/8\".\nFèy A8.1: tip H2-4-30 (6 1/4\", 2 h) ak H2-6-30 (7 1/4\", 2 h); Detay 2B \"Detail at Shaft Walls\"; Detay 3 ak 5 \"Elevator Shaft Detail\"\n  (studs C-H ak shaftliner 1\"). Fèy A7.12: detay \"Elevator Door Head and Jamb Detail at Shaft Wall\".\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"04_061053_Carpinteria_Rough_y_Blocking.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 06 10 53 – CHAPANTRI BRIT DIVÈS (MISCELLANEOUS ROUGH CARPENTRY) – BLOCKING","texto":"SEKSYON 06 10 53 – CHAPANTRI BRIT DIVÈS (MISCELLANEOUS ROUGH CARPENTRY) – BLOCKING\n========================\nVèsyon ki an vigè: Addendum 2, paj PDF 36-43. Chanjman konpare ak Manual V1:\n  - Nouvo 2.04 G: kowòdone bwa ki trete ak prezèvatif ak manbràn yo.\n  - Nouvo 2.08 A.3: vis an asye pa pyès Tip 304 kote yo ekspoze a move tan, an kontak ak tè a,\n    nan bwa ki trete ak prezèvatif oswa ak imidite relatif ki wo.\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nSeksyon 06 10 00 \"Rough Carpentry\" pa egziste; se sèl seksyon chapantri brit sa a ki genyen (gade FALTANTES.txt).\n\n1. ESPAS TRAVAY: bòdi (curbs); blocking, chanfren (cants) ak nailers; furring ak grounds; travès (sleepers); ranfò an playwood (plywood backing).\n2. BWA: DOC PS 20; imidite ≤ 19 %.\n3. TRETMAN PREZÈVATIF: AWPA U1, kategori UC2 / UC3b / UC4a; san asenik ni kwòm; pa sèvi ak SBX sou sòl yo. Seche nan fou a 19 %.\n   Seksyon an bay lis eleman ki trete yo. Sèvi ak vis ak flashing an asye pa pyès seri 300 an kontak ak bwa ki trete.\n4. BWA KI REZISTE DIFE (FRT)\n   - Endis pwopagasyon flanm ≤ 25 nan tès pwolonje 30 min; devan flanm ≤ 10.5 ft.\n   - Tip deyò teste dapre ASTM D2898. Tip anndan A: ≤ 28 % imidite a 92 % HR.\n   - Faktè konsepsyon 0.85 / 0.75. Seche nan fou: bwa 19 %, playwood 15 %.\n   - FRT obligatwa nan: chapantri anndan asanblaj ki gen rating, platfòm ki leve ak ranfò an playwood.\n     Pa sou twati, sof si fabrikan twati a konfime sa.\n5. BWA DIVÈS: klas Construction oswa No. 2 (lis espès); planch kache ak 19 % imidite.\n6. RANFÒ AN PLAYWOOD: FRT, epesè minimòm 3/4\".\n7. FIKSASYON\n   - Konektè G185 / ASTM A153 Klas D; konektè pa pyès 316 / A153 Klas C; pa pyès 304 (gade chanjman Addendum 2).\n   - Klou ASTM F1667. Vis ASTM C1002 pou asye ki pa estriktirèl ak C954 pou asye ki fòme a frèt.\n   - Fiksasyon ak poud ICC AC70; lank AC01 / AC58 / AC193 / AC308.\n   - Kòl ASTM D3498 san ire-fòmaldeyid. Flashing fleksib ≥ 0.025\".\n8. EGZEKISYON\n   - Dapre WCD 1. Playwood FRT enstale ak mak la vizib.\n   - Klip metal a ≤ 16\" o.c. nan kwen plak jips.\n   - Fire blocking: nan chak etaj ak plafon epi a ≤ 96\" o.c.; travès nan zòn ≤ 100 ft²; kòniche a ≤ 20 ft.\n   - Tretman sou teren pou koupe yo dapre AWPA M4. Flashing separatè sou steel deck.\n   - Fiksasyon dapre IBC Tablo 2304.9.1. Bwa ki trete pa dwe touche steel deck la (sèvi ak manbràn oswa sapen kè bwa ki pa trete).\n   - RANFÒ AN PLAYWOOD: vis a ≤ 24\" o.c.; nan miray ki gen rating, sou plak ki gen rating lan; fèy 48\" x 96\" orizontal\n     nan wotè plafon an; san twou.\n   - Pwoteje ak borat bwa ki trete ak SBX.\nRapò ak 092216: blocking nan miray studs metal ka an bwa FRT oswa an fèy metal (092216 Egzekisyon).\nFèy A8.1, nòt 13: miray ki sipòte kabinè, etajè, ba sipò, ekipman ak akseswa miray dwe ranfòse dapre\nfabrikan akseswa a ak dènye edisyon kòd konstriksyon eta a, sa ki pi gwo a.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"05_A8.1_Tipos_de_Pared_Notas_y_Cedulas.txt":{"titulo":"FÈY A8.1 – TIP SEPARASYON AK TABLO (PARTITION TYPES AND SCHEDULES), REVIZYON RFI-A8.1","texto":"FÈY A8.1 – TIP SEPARASYON AK TABLO (PARTITION TYPES AND SCHEDULES), REVIZYON RFI-A8.1\n========================\nSous: \"A8.1 - PARTITION TYPES AND SCHEDULES - RFI-A8.1\" (1 paj). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nFèy la bay lis plizyè revizyon (addenda ak RFI; nimewo yo retire).\n\nNÒT JENERAL (tradiksyon fidèl)\n 1. Tout framing studs estanda a 16\" o.c. sof endikasyon; tout framing SHAFT WALL a 24\" o.c. sof endikasyon.\n 2. Rating dife dapre plan kòd yo.\n 3. Tout plak 5/8\" Tip X sof endikasyon; pentire tout fas ki parèt.\n 4. Plak baz Tip X an fib vè ki reziste dlo nan plas dènye kouch plak la, kote yo endike sa nan tip tablo a,\n    sou miray mouye anndan (douch, twalèt) ak sou miray basen ki pa gen rating epi ki pa akoustik.\n 5. Plak Tip X ki reziste imidite ak kanni nan tout kote anndan ki \"mouye\", ladan yo twalèt yo.\n 6. Tip miray anwo oswa anba yon ouvèti se menm ak tip nenpòt nan de bò li yo.\n 7. Diferan tip miray yo aliyen pou plan miray yo kontinye san kase anndan chanm yo, sof endikasyon.\n 8. Kòt miray anndan yo se jis nan fas plak jips la.\n    Apre nòt 8, fèy la gen paragraf sa a san pwòp nimewo: miray ki gen rating fòme yon separasyon kontinyèl soti nan yon planche rive nan lòt,\n    san entèripsyon nan kolòn, pout, tranzisyon oswa obstak; nan kondisyon ki gen rating, pèsaj yo sele ak silikòn kont dife.\n 9. Izolasyon sou tout lajè stud la, jiska 6\" pwofondè maksimòm nan miray yo; R-19 san baryè nan furring anndan bò miray\n    deyò ki pa izole (beton, CMU, panno spandrel nan fenèt/miray rido); kontinyèl otou kolòn ki kouvri ak obstak.\n10. STUDS KALIB 25 nan tout miray akoustik ak yon sèl stud, sof endikasyon. Sèvi ak studs knurled oswa ajiste espas la dapre pòte a.\n    Espas la PA KA pi piti pase 16\" o.c. san apwobasyon achitèk la (tèks: \"SPACING SHALL BE NO LESS THAN 16\" O.C.\").\n    Ou ka sèvi ak kalib ki pi lou nan miray ki pa akoustik oswa ak stud doub.\n    PÒTE MAKSIMÒM baze sou defleksyon L/240 ak chaj konsepsyon 5 psf, sof endikasyon.\n11. Miray akoustik yo gen kouvèti sou tout lajè stud la epi yo sele byen sere ak silikòn akoustik ant plak la ak dal, pout,\n    kolòn, miray oswa asye, nan pèsaj ak nan materyèl diferan. Yo akoustik, sof endikasyon:\n    a) miray separasyon inite ak lokal komèsyal; b) miray koulwa; c) miray deyò (izolasyon tèmik);\n    d) espas studs ak plonbri; e) ti miray ak plonbri; f) miray twalèt; g) shaft walls nan inite yo;\n    h) miray spandrel ak miray deyò ki kouvri (tèmik); i) miray ant espas ki klimatize ak espas ki pa klimatize (tèmik);\n    j) miray nan zòn piblik/komen, ladan yo lobi rezidansyèl ak sal ki fèmen.\n12. Sistèm jwen ki reziste dife ant miray ak planche/plafon ki reziste dife, dapre [kòd eta a] 2015, Seksyon 706.\n13. Miray ak kabinè, etajè, ba sipò, ekipman ak akseswa: ranfòse dapre fabrikan akseswa a ak kòd konstriksyon an vigè, sa ki pi gwo a.\n\nKLE TIP (egzanp etikèt \"SA.3.10\": materyèl . rating/wotè . lajè . endikatè plak . kondisyon inik)\n  Materyèl: S = asye (studs metal); W = studs an bwa; H = shaft wall; M = masonri; C = beton.\n  Rating/wotè: A = tout wotè jis nan estrikti a; B = 6\" anwo plafon an; C = jis anba plafon an; D = yon pati wotè a;\n    S = separasyon lafimen; Y = wotè varyab (tout san rating); 0 = 0 h (koulwa); 5 = 0.5 h; 1, 2, 3, 4 = èdtan rating.\n  Lajè: F = furring/kanal; 1 = 1 5/8\" metal; 2 = 2 1/2\" metal / 1 1/2\" bwa; 3 = 3 5/8\" metal; 4 = 4\" metal / 3 1/2\" bwa / 3 5/8\" CMU / 4\" beton;\n    6 = 6\" metal / 5 1/2\" bwa / 5 5/8\" CMU / 6\" beton; 8 = 8\" metal / 7 1/4\" bwa / 7 5/8\" CMU / 8\" beton; 10 = 10\" beton;\n    12 = 11 5/8\" CMU / 12\" beton; D = stud doub; S = studs altène; Y = lajè ki pa estanda.\n  Plak (san shaftliner): 0 = san plak; 1 = yon kouch bò etikèt la; 2 = yon kouch chak bò; 3 = de kouch bò etikèt la ak youn lòt bò a;\n    4 = de kouch chak bò; 5 = de kouch bò etikèt la ak anyen lòt bò a; 6 = twa kouch chak bò.\n  Kondisyon inik: 0 = okenn; 1 = stud ki pote chaj (mak retire); 2 = kouvèti akoustik (SAB); 3 = kanal rezilyan + SAB; 4 = plak baz pou mozayik;\n    5 = miray beton ak kofraj fèy ondile; 6 = framing tipik anba joist la; 7 = miray beton ak kofraj ondile\n    + kanal rezilyan ak plak bò eskalye a; 8 = plak baz pou mozayik ak baryè lè ak vapè.\n  Studs ki pote chaj yo make ak achi sou plan yo (seri A1/A2, pa disponib).\n  Grafik tip yo: \"NO LIMITING HEIGHT IF BRACED TO ADJACENT CONSTRUCTION\" (pa gen limit wotè si li kontreventé ak konstriksyon ki bò kote l).\n\nTABLO (epesè total; rating; STC/kòmantè). Kolòn asanblaj ki teste, detay anwo/anba yo vid sof \"UL ###\".\n  San rating SA-X-1X: SA-1-10 ak SA-1-16 varyab; SA-3-10 varyab; SA-3-12 ak SA-3-18 4 1/4\"; SA-6-10/12/18 6 5/8\".\n  San rating SA-X-2X: SA-3-20/22/28 4 7/8\"; SA-6-20/22/28 7 1/4\"; SD-3-20 4 7/8\".\n  1 h S1-X-2X: S1-3-10 4 1/4\"; S1-3-20 4 7/8\"; S1-3-23 varyab, STC 64 (separasyon rezidansyèl/fitness); S1-6-13 7 1/8\", STC 56 (koulwa/separasyon tipik);\n    S1-6-20 ak S1-6-22 7 1/4\"; S1-6-23 7 3/4\", STC 56 (koulwa/separasyon tipik); S1-6-42 8 1/2\"; S1-8-20 9 1/4\".\n  2 h S2-X-4X: S2-3-40 6 1/8\"; S2-6-40 ak S2-6-41 8 1/2\".\n  Shaft 2 h H2-X-3X: H2-4-30 6 1/4\"; H2-6-30 7 1/4\".\n  Masonri: M1-8-00 7 5/8\" (1 h); M2-8-00 7 5/8\" (2 h); M4-8-00 7 5/8\" (4 h); M0-8-00 7 5/8\" (0 h).\n  Beton san rating: CA-6-00 6\"; CA-12-00 varyab. Beton 2 h: C2-6-00 6\"; C2-8-00 8\" (UL ###); C2-10-00 10\"; C2-10-07 1'-0 5/8\" (beton wall);\n    C2-11-05 1'-0 1/8\" (UL ###); C2-11-07 1'-1 5/8\" (UL ###); C2-12-00 1'-0\"; C2-18-00 1'-6\" (UL ###).\nDETAY: 2B \"Detail at Shaft Walls\"; 3 ak 5 \"Elevator Shaft Detail\". Lejand: fireproofing yo flite (nimewo UL pou soukontraktè framing metal la verifye).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"06_A3.21_Framing_de_Plafones.txt":{"titulo":"FÈY A3.21 – DETAY PLAFON (CEILING DETAILS), IFC: FRAMING","texto":"FÈY A3.21 – DETAY PLAFON (CEILING DETAILS), IFC: FRAMING\n========================\nSous: \"A3.21-CEILING DETAILS-IFC\" (1 paj). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n\n- Nòt 10: miray yo rive anba dal la, eksepte miray ki gen lonbraj yo, kote plak la monte 4\" anwo plafon an.\n  TOUT studs metal yo rive jis anba dal planche a oswa dal twati a.\n- Tip plafon: GWB-1 = plak sou studs metal ki pandye nan asanblaj planche ki gen rating; GWB-2 = kole sou estrikti a (gade A6.0);\n  GWB-3 = plafon ak rating 2 h sou studs metal.\n- Plafon an plak tipik: plak 5/8\"; studs 3 5/8\" a 16\" o.c.; kontrevantman a 32\" o.c.\n- Studs a 16\" o.c., ak pwofondè pou L/240 maksimòm, sof endikasyon.\n- 1C: jwen ekspansyon 1\" ak kouvèti kontinyèl.\n- 1D: casing bead sou perimèt la separe 1/4\" ak miray la, ak backer rod ak silikòn.\n- 2A Jwen kontwòl: kanal 1 1/2\"; furring kontinyèl a 4\" maksimòm chak bò; espas 1/4\"; kanal ki antre youn nan lòt kwaze 16\"\n  ak 2 mare fil chak bò; jwenti furring ranvèse.\n- 2C/2D Panno aksè: konpoze sou perimèt ouvèti a; ouvèti = lajè panno a + 1/4\"; SAB kenbe ak bann metal.\n- 2E Bwat (box header): vis an asye pa pyès 1/4\" a 12\" o.c. (\"verify\" sou fèy la).\nGade tou 092216 (sispansyon: pandye ak kanal pòtè a 48\" o.c., furring a 16\" o.c.).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"07_A7_Escaleras_Elevador_y_Hoistway.txt":{"titulo":"FÈY A7.x – ESKALYE, ASANSÈ AK HOISTWAY: FRAMING","texto":"FÈY A7.x – ESKALYE, ASANSÈ AK HOISTWAY: FRAMING\n========================\nSous: \"A7.10-STAIR AND ELEVATOR DETAILS-IFC\" ak \"A7.12-ELEVATOR DETAILS-IFC\" (1 paj chak).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n- A7.10: \"GWB ON METAL STUDS BETWEEN STRINGERS AND ALONG BEAM/BELOW LANDING - SEE SECTIONS\"\n  (plak sou studs metal ant limon yo ak sou longè pout la ak anba palye a; gade koup yo).\n  \"CASING BEAD AND 1/4\" SEALANT WHERE GWB OCCURS\" (casing bead ak silikòn 1/4\" kote ki gen plak).\n- A7.12: detay \"ELEVATOR DOOR HEAD AND JAMB DETAIL AT SHAFT WALL\" (anwo ak chanbrann pòt asansè nan shaft wall).\n  Egzijans pòtay chanbrann an J (janm 3\", ≥ 0.033\") yo nan 092116.23 (fichye 03).\n- Fèy A7.2, A7.3 (RFI-A8.1) ak A7.4 (plan ak koup eskalye 2 ak hoistway) te revize epi yo pa gen tèks framing.\n  Yo pa t kopye.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"08_092900_Requisitos_de_la_Placa_sobre_el_Framing.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 (RFI-092900) – EGZIJANS KI AFEKTE FRAMING NAN","texto":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 (RFI-092900) – EGZIJANS KI AFEKTE FRAMING NAN\n========================\nSous: \"092900 - GYPSUM BOARD - RFI-092900\". PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n(paj 7-9; vis yo nan 2.3, paj 6, ki nan kopi konplè dosye finishing la).\n- 3.1 Egzamen (p.7): anvan ou mete plak la, verifye framing, blocking, izolasyon ak firestopping fini epi yo kòrèk.\n- Vis dapre epesè framing (2.3): ASTM C1002 pou framing ki mwens pase 0.033\"; ASTM C954 pou 0.033\" a 0.112\"; bwa tip W ak 3/4\" penetrasyon.\n- 3.3.A (p.8): fikse plak la sou framing ak furring dapre fabrikan an, GA-216 oswa ASTM C840.\n- 3.3.E (p.8): kote plak la monte tout wotè jis nan estrikti a, kite espas pou defleksyon an lè w koupe plak la 3/8\" (nominal)\n  epi sele bò anwo a sou sipò a ak yon kòdon silikòn kontinyèl, ki fè yon fèmti elastik.\n- 3.3.F: fikse plak la sou framing nan ak vis.\n- Jwen kontwòl (3.3, p.8-9): kote direksyon framing nan chanje ak nan tranzisyon framing ki chita sou planche a pou framing ki pandye.\n- 3.5 (p.9): plak ki toufe son vise a 16\" o.c. omwen.\n- 3.7 (p.10, nan dosye finishing): plak siman ak blocking anplis kote li nesesè; bò ki paralèl ak framing ak sipò kontinyèl.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF la (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"09_Resumen_Espaciado_Calibres_y_Deflexion.txt":{"titulo":"REZIME KONPILE – ESPAS STUDS, EPESÈ/KALIB, TRACK AK DEFLEKSYON","texto":"REZIME KONPILE – ESPAS STUDS, EPESÈ/KALIB, TRACK AK DEFLEKSYON\n========================\nSe sèlman sa sous yo di ki konpile. Chak done gen orijin li (gade fichye 01-08).\n\nESPAS STUDS\n  - Studs estanda: 16\" o.c. sof endikasyon ...................................... A8.1 nòt 1\n  - Shaft wall: 24\" o.c. sof endikasyon .......................................... A8.1 nòt 1 (092116.23 voye sou sistèm nan)\n  - Maksimòm 16\" o.c. ak yon kouch, plizyè kouch, baz pou mozayik, steam room ak finisyon rijid ... 092216 Egzekisyon\n  - Miray akoustik ak yon sèl stud: \"no less than 16\" o.c.\" san apwobasyon ... A8.1 nòt 10\n  - Plafon an plak: studs 3 5/8\" a 16\" o.c., kontrevantman a 32\" o.c. .......... A3.21\n  - Framing estriktirèl 054000: \"As indicated on Drawings\" (pa gen valè) ....... 054000 Egzekisyon\n  - Miray koub: 6\" o.c. nan de bout ak la ......................................... 092216\n  - Furring sou beton ak Z-furring: 24\" o.c. ..................................... 092216\n  - Sispansyon: pandye 48\" o.c., kanal pòtè 48\", furring 16\" ................... 092216\nEPESÈ / KALIB\n  - Studs ki pa estriktirèl: ≥ 0.0179\"; anbose ≥ 0.0147\" ........................ 092216\n  - Studs kalib 25 nan miray akoustik ak yon sèl stud ............................ A8.1 nòt 10\n  - Shaft wall: studs ≥ 0.018\"; J-runner janm long ≥ 2\"; chanbrann asansè J 3\", ≥ 0.033\" ... 092116.23\n  - Fòme a frèt (054000): studs/track deyò ak anndan 0.0428\" (zèl 1-5/8\"; track anndan zèl 1-1/4\");\n    track defleksyon 0.0428\"; joists plafon ak sofit 0.0428\" .................... 054000\n  - Lajè nominal: 1 5/8\", 2 1/2\", 3 5/8\", 4\", 6\", 8\" (kle tip) .................. A8.1\nTRACK / TÈT MIRAY\n  - Runner janm long ak zèl 2\" + bridging nan 12\" anwo a; runner doub; klip; track defleksyon ... 092216\n  - Track firestop ak sele (UL 2079, ±50 %) nan miray ki gen rating ............. 092216\n  - Track firestop nan tèt shaft wall la nan chak nivo ............................ 092116.23\n  - Bridging anwo nan 12\" yon track defleksyon senp; bridging ≤ 48\" vètikal ... 054000\n  - Mouvman vètikal konsepsyon ±3/4\" ............................................... 054000\n  - Plak koupe 3/8\" epi sele kote li rive nan estrikti a (defleksyon) ............ 092900 RFI-092900\n  - Tout studs jis anba dal la .................................................... A3.21 nòt 10\nDEFLEKSYON\n  - Miray anndan L/240 a 5 psf .................................... 092216, 054000 ak A8.1 nòt 10\n  - Finisyon rijid L/360 ............................................ 092216\n  - Shaft HVAC ak asansè: 10 psf ..................................... 092216\n  - Miray deyò L/240 (054000); deyò dapre plan estriktirèl yo (092216)\n  - Plafon L/240 a 5 psf; rijid L/360; steam room L/360 a 7.5 psf ... 092216. Joists plafon L/240 ... 054000. Plafon L/240 ... A3.21\nTOLERANS\n  - 1/8\" (092216 ak 092116.23); 1/8\" sou 10 ft (054000); plafon nivo 1/8\" sou 12 ft (092216).\n"},"04_bastidor_metalico_092216.txt":{"titulo":"FRAMING METAL KI PA ESTRIKTIRÈL - SEKSYON 092216 (V1 p745-754)","texto":"FRAMING METAL KI PA ESTRIKTIRÈL - SEKSYON 092216 (V1 p745-754)\n(detay monte studs, tracks, furring ak sispansyon)\n\n1. KOUVÈTI TRAVAY (1.02.A, p745)\n- \"Non-load-bearing steel framing systems for interior partitions.\"\n- \"Suspension systems for interior ceilings and soffits.\"\n- \"Grid suspension systems for gypsum board ceilings.\"\n\n2. DEFLEKSYON / PÈFÒMANS (2.02, p746-747)\n- \"Horizontal Deflection - Typical: For wall assemblies, limited to 1/240 of the wall height based on horizontal loading as follows: Typical: 5 lbf/sq. ft. / Shaft Walls at HVAC Shafts: 10 lbf/sq. ft. / Shaft Walls at Elevator Shafts: 10 lbf/sq. ft.\"\n- \"Horizontal Deflection - Rigid Applied Surface Materials: ... limited to 1/360 of the wall height\" (menm chaj).\n- Plafon: \"limited to 1/240 of the span based on loading of 5 lbf/sq. ft.\"; rijid 1/360; steam rooms 1/360 a 7.5 lbf/sq. ft.\n\n3. MATERYÈL (2.03, p747-749)\n- Studs ak runners: \"ASTM C 645. Use either steel studs and runners or embossed steel studs and runners.\"\n- Steel studs: \"Minimum Base-Metal Thickness: As required by performance requirements for horizontal deflection but at minimum 0.0179 inch.\" ; \"Depth: As indicated on Drawings.\"\n- Embossed studs: \"... but at minimum 0.0147 inch.\"\n- Kouch pwoteksyon: \"G40, hot-dip galvanized\"; steam rooms \"G90\".\n- Flat strap / backing plate: \"Minimum Base-Metal Thickness: 0.0329 inch.\"\n- Cold-rolled channel bridging: \"0.0538-inch minimum base-metal thickness, with minimum 1/2-inch- wide flanges.\" ; clip angle \"1-1/2 by 1-1/2 inches, 0.068-inch- thick\".\n- Hat-shaped rigid furring: \"ASTM C 645. Minimum Base-Metal Thickness: 0.0179 inch.\"\n- Z-furring: \"face flange of 1-1/4 inches, wall attachment flange of 7/8 inch, minimum uncoated-metal thickness of 0.0179 inch\".\n- Isolation strip (2.05.B, p750): \"Adhesive-backed, closed-cell vinyl foam strips ... 1/8 inch thick\".\n- A8.1 N10: \"STUDS TO BE 25 GA AT ALL SINGLE-STUD ACOUSTICAL WALLS U.O.N.\"\n\n4. ENSTALASYON JENERAL (3.03, p751)\n- \"Installation Standard: ASTM C 754.\" / \"Gypsum Board Assemblies: Also comply with requirements in ASTM C 840 that apply to framing installation.\"\n- \"Install framing and accessories plumb, square, and true to line, with connections securely fastened.\"\n- \"Install bracing at terminations in assemblies.\"\n- \"Do not bridge building control and expansion joints with non-load-bearing steel framing members. Frame both sides of joints independently.\"\n\n5. ESPAS STUDS (3.04.A, p751-752)\n- \"Single-Layer Application: As required by deflection performance requirements; but at maximum 16 inches o.c.\"\n- \"Multilayer Application: ... but at maximum 16 inches o.c.\"\n- \"Tile Backing Panels: ... but at maximum 16 inches o.c.\"\n- \"Assemblies to Receive Rigid Applied Surface Materials: ... but at maximum 16 inches o.c.\"\n- A8.1 N1: standard 16\" o.c.; shaft wall 24\" o.c. UNO.\n\n6. MONTAJ (3.04.B-D, p752)\n- \"Where studs are installed directly against exterior masonry walls or dissimilar metals at exterior walls, install isolation strip between studs and exterior wall.\"\n- \"Install studs so flanges within framing system point in same direction.\"\n- \"Install tracks (runners) at floors and overhead supports. Extend framing full height to structural supports or substrates above suspended ceilings except where partitions are indicated to terminate at suspended ceilings.\"\n- Pòt: \"Screw vertical studs at jambs to jamb anchor clips on door frames\"; \"Install two studs at each jamb unless otherwise indicated.\"; cripple studs \"with a minimum 1/2-inch clearance from jamb stud to allow for installation of control joint\"; \"Extend jamb studs through suspended ceilings and attach to underside of overhead structure.\"\n- Separasyon koub: \"On straight lengths of no fewer than two studs at ends of arcs, place studs 6 inches o.c.\"\n- Direct furring (p752-753): beton/masonri \"spaced 24 inches o.c.\"\n- Z-furring (p753): \"spaced 24 inches o.c.\"; kwen anndan \"no more than 12 inches from corner\".\n- Tolerans (3.04.H, p753): \"Install each framing member so fastening surfaces vary not more than 1/8 inch from the plane formed by faces of adjacent framing.\"\n\n7. SISPANSYON PLAFON (3.05, p753-754)\n- \"Hangers: 48 inches o.c.\" / \"Carrying Channels (Main Runners): 48 inches o.c.\" / \"Furring Channels (Furring Members): 16 inches o.c.\"\n- \"Fire-Resistance-Rated Assemblies: Wire tie furring channels to supports.\"\n- \"Do not attach hangers to steel roof deck.\" ; \"Do not connect or suspend steel framing from ducts, pipes, or conduit.\"\n- Tolerans: \"level to within 1/8 inch in 12 feet\".\n\n8. COLD-FORMED (054000, A3 p171-180) - ki gen rapò\n- A3 p171: \"Interior Non-Load-Bearing Framing: Horizontal deflection of 1/240 of the wall height under a horizontal load of 5 lbf/sq. ft.\"\n- A3 p179 3.5.B: \"Fasten both flanges of studs to top and bottom track unless otherwise indicated.\" ; \"Stud Spacing: As indicated on Drawings.\"\n- A3 p179-180: bridging \"not more than 48 inches apart. Fasten at each stud intersection.\"\n\n9. PA JWENN\n- Kalib/epesè espesifik studs pou miray 2 h (S2, H2): PA JWENN (sèlman minimòm ak \"as indicated\").\n- Wotè limit pou chak tip miray: PA JWENN (sèlman nòt \"NO LIMITING HEIGHT IF BRACED TO ADJACENT CONSTRUCTION\" nan detay shaft A8.1).\n"},"05_RC1_resilient_channel.txt":{"titulo":"RC1 / RESILIENT CHANNEL","texto":"RC1 / RESILIENT CHANNEL\n\n1. TÈM \"RC1\" / \"RC-1\"\n- PA JWENN kòm resilient channel nan okenn sous.\n- Sèl kote \"RC-1\" parèt: V2 p113 \"Type RC-1 (Roof Curb, Type 1)\" -> se pa drywall.\n\n2. ESPESIFIKASYON (092216)\n- 2.03.J (V1 p749): \"Resilient Furring Channels: 1/2-inch- deep, steel sheet members designed to reduce sound transmission.\"\n  \"Configuration: Asymmetrical or hat shaped.\"\n- 2.04.F.5 (V1 p750, sispansyon): \"Resilient Furring Channels: 1/2-inch- deep members designed to reduce sound transmission.\"\n  \"Configuration: Asymmetrical or hat shaped.\"\n- Espas furring nan plafon (3.05.A.3, V1 p753): \"Furring Channels (Furring Members): 16 inches o.c.\" (jeneral, pa espesifik pou resilient).\n\n3. KOTE LI APLIKE (A8.1)\n- Kondisyon inik 3: \"RESILIENT CHANNELS W/ SOUND ATTENUATION BLANKET\"\n- Kondisyon inik 7: \"... CORRUGATED METAL FORMWORK AND RESILIENT CHANNEL W/ GWB FINISH ON STAIR SIDE\"\n- Lejand detay: \"RESILIENT CHANNEL (WHERE UNIQUE CONDITION MODIFIER 3 IS INDICATED)\"\n- Lejand detay: \"... W/ FURRING CHANNEL AND GYPSUM BOARD FINISH ON STAIR INTERIOR SIDE (WHERE UNIQUE CONDITION MODIFIER 7 IS INDICATED)\"\n- Tip nan tablo a ak modifikatè 3: S1-3-23 (11 3/4\", STC 64, \"RESIDENTIAL / FITNESS SEPARATION\") ak S1-6-23 (7 3/4\", STC 56, \"TYPICAL CORRIDOR / DEMISING\").\n- Tip ak modifikatè 7: C2-10-07 ak C2-11-07 (beton 2 h).\n\n4. PA JWENN\n- Kalib / epesè metal resilient channel la: PA JWENN (sèlman pwofondè 1/2\").\n- Espas resilient channel sou miray: PA JWENN.\n- Vis pou fikse RC sou stud la ak plak la sou RC a (tip, longè, espas): PA JWENN.\n- Nòt enstalasyon (evite short-circuit, oryantasyon, distans ak planche/plafon): PA JWENN.\n- Fabrikan/pwodwi RC: PA JWENN.\n"},"11_deflection_head_of_wall.txt":{"titulo":"DEFLECTION TRACKS / HEAD-OF-WALL","texto":"DEFLECTION TRACKS / HEAD-OF-WALL\n\n1. 092216 HEAD JOINTS (2.03.D, V1 p748)\n- \"Slip-Type Head Joints: Where indicated, provide one of the following:\"\n- \"Clip System: Clips designed for use in head-of-wall deflection conditions that provide a positive attachment of studs to tracks while allowing 1-1/2-inch minimum vertical movement.\"\n- \"Single Long-Leg Runner System: ASTM C 645 top runner with 2-inch- deep flanges in thickness not less than indicated for studs, installed with studs friction fit into top runner and with continuous bridging located within 12 inches of the top of studs to provide lateral bracing.\"\n- \"Double-Runner System: ASTM C 645 top runners, inside runner with 2-inch- deep flanges in thickness not less than indicated for studs and fastened to studs, and outer runner sized to friction fit inside runner.\"\n- \"Deflection Track: Steel sheet top runner manufactured to prevent cracking of finishes applied to interior partition framing resulting from deflection of structure above; in thickness not less than indicated for studs and in width to accommodate depth of studs.\"\n- 2.03.E: \"Firestop Tracks: Top runner ... designed to allow partition heads to expand and contract with movement of structure while maintaining continuity of fire-resistance-rated assembly indicated; in thickness not less than indicated for studs and in width to accommodate depth of studs.\"\n- 2.03.G: smoke and acoustic track seal (pwodwi a retire).\n- 3.04.D.1 (V1 p752): \"Slip-Type Head Joints: Where framing extends to overhead structural supports, install to produce joints at tops of framing systems that prevent axial loading of finished assemblies.\"\n\n2. 092900 - ESPAS ANWO (3.3.E, V1 p762 / RFI-092900 p8)\n- \"Where gypsum board abuts dissimilar materials and at the top of walls, provide a joint by undercutting board 3/8 inch (nominal) and sealing top edge to adjacent surface with a continuous bead of sealant to form an elastic closure.\"\n\n3. 092116.23 (V1 p741)\n- \"Firestop Tracks: Provide firestop track at head of shaft wall on each floor level.\"\n\n4. 054000 (Addendum 3)\n- A3 p171: \"Design framing system to maintain clearances at openings, to allow for construction tolerances, and to accommodate live load deflection of primary building structure as follows: Upward and downward movement of 3/4 inch.\"\n- A3 p172-174: \"Slotted Deflection Track\", \"Single Deflection Track: Manufacturer's single, deep-leg, U-shaped steel track; unpunched\", \"Double Deflection Tracks: Manufacturer's double, deep-leg, U-shaped steel tracks\"; \"Minimum Base-Steel Thickness: 0.0428 inch.\"\n- A3 p179: \"Top Bridging for Single Deflection Track: Install row of horizontal bridging within 12 inches of single deflection track.\"\n\n5. 078400\n- 2.03.B (V1 p538): head-of-wall ant planche san rating ak miray ki gen rating: \"tested according to ASTM E2837\".\n- Tablo 3.08: \"HW\" = Head of Wall (sèlman gid).\n\n6. A3.21\n- N10: \"ALL METAL STUDS EXTEND TO UNDERSIDE OF FLOOR OR ROOF DECK.\"\n- 1E: \"METAL STUDS @ 16\" O.C., DEPTH TO RESULT IN DEFLECTION OF L/240 MAX, UNO\"\n- 1D: \"PERIMETER CASING BEAD - HOLD OFF THE WALL TO PROVIDE 1/4\" GAP\" ; \"BACKER ROD AND SEALANT\"\n\n7. PA JWENN\n- Detay grafik head-of-wall (A8.1 kolòn \"T.O. WALL DETAIL\" vid): PA JWENN.\n- Espas defleksyon espesifik (egz. 3/4\" oswa 1\") pou separasyon anba dal: PA JWENN nan 092216 (sèlman klip 1-1/2\" min. mouvman ak 3/4\" nan 054000).\n"},"13_blocking_refuerzos.txt":{"titulo":"BLOCKING AK RANFÒSMAN","texto":"BLOCKING AK RANFÒSMAN\n\n1. 092216 3.04.G (V1 p753)\n- \"Install fire treated wood blocking or mechanically fastened sheet metal blocking\" pou: framed openings, casework/cabinets, plumbing fixtures, toilet partitions, grab bars, toilet accessories, door hardware ak ekipman AV (lis rezime).\n- Rampla/grab bars: \"reinforcing strip\" \"0.0312 inch\" (rezime; gade seksyon an).\n- 2.03.H (V1 p749): \"Flat Strap and Backing Plate: Steel sheet for blocking and bracing ... Minimum Base-Metal Thickness: 0.0329 inch.\"\n\n2. 092116.23 3.03.D (V1 p743)\n- \"provide galvanized steel reinforcing strip with 0.033-inch minimum thickness of base metal (uncoated), accurately positioned and secured behind at least one layer of face panel.\"\n\n3. 092900 3.1 (V1 p761 / RFI-092900 p7-8)\n- Verifye blocking enstale anvan ou mete plak (rezime).\n\n4. A8.1 N13\n- \"WALL SUPPORTING CASEWORK, SHELVING, GRAB BARS, EQUIPMENT AND OTHER WALL-MOUNTED FIXTURES SHALL BE RINFORCED PER THE FIXTURE MANUFACTURER'S REQUIREMENTS AND THE REQUIREMENTS OF THE LATEST EDITION OF THE [KÒD KONSTRIKSYON ETA A], WHICHEVER IS GREATER.\"\n\n5. PA JWENN\n- Detay blocking (wotè, dimansyon, fiksasyon): PA JWENN.\n- Plan elevasyon anndan ak kote blocking yo ye: PA JWENN.\n"},"12_aislamiento_acustico.txt":{"titulo":"IZOLASYON (SOUND ATTENUATION) AK SELE AKOUSTIK","texto":"IZOLASYON (SOUND ATTENUATION) AK SELE AKOUSTIK\n\n1. A8.1\n- N9: \"INSULATION SHALL BE FULL STUD WIDTH (MAX 6\"). PROVIDE UNFACED R-19 BATT INSULATION AT FURRING ADJACENT TO UNINSULATED EXTERIOR WALLS. INSULATION SHALL BE CONTINUOUS AROUND FURRED COLUMNS.\"\n- N11: miray akoustik ak batt tout lajè, sele byen sere ak silikòn akoustik; aplike pou: a) demising, b) corridor, c) exterior, d) plumbing bays, e) pony walls, f) bathroom, g) \"SHAFT WALLS AT UNITS\", h) spandrel, i) conditioned/unconditioned, j) public areas (lis rezime; gade fèy la).\n- Kondisyon inik 2: sound attenuation blanket; 3: \"RESILIENT CHANNELS W/ SOUND ATTENUATION BLANKET\".\n- STC nan tablo a: S1-3-23 = 64; S1-6-13 = 56; S1-6-23 = 56.\n\n2. 098100 ACOUSTIC INSULATION (A2 p156-160; V1 p828-832)\n- Batt: \"ASTM C665 Type I unfaced\", dansite \"0.60 pcf\"; \"Select batt thickness to fill cavity airspace\".\n- 3.3.A.1: \"Sound batt insulation is required to be installed in floors, unit demising walls, corridor wall assemblies, bathroom walls, and all bedroom walls.\"\n- 3.3.A.2: STC 64 obligatwa nan zòn amenity, fitness, loading dock ak mechanical (rezime).\n- Pèsaj: \"Any gap larger than 1/2-inch shall be covered with gypsum board, lapped a minimum of 2-inches, and screwed before using acoustical sealant.\"\n\n3. 072100 THERMAL INSULATION (A3 p227-235)\n- Kavite metal >96\": \"support unfaced blankets mechanically\" (rezime A3 p234-235).\n- \"Insulation in Metal Framed Walls: Mineral-wool blanket or glass-fiber blanket insulation.\"\n\n4. 092900 SOUND DAMPING (3.5, V1 p763 / RFI-092900 p9)\n- Espas sou perimèt 1/4\" a 1/2\" ak silikòn akoustik; \"Comply with ASTM C919\"; vis \"16 inches o.c.\" minimòm; kòdon silikòn 1/8\" a 3/8\"; putty dèyè bwat yo (rezime; gade 01_patron_tornillos.txt).\n- 3.1 (V1 p761): verifye izolasyon anvan ou fèmen.\n\n5. 079219 ACOUSTICAL JOINT SEALANTS (V1 p562-566)\n- Silikòn latèks \"ASTM C834\".\n- \"STC-Rated Assemblies: Seal construction at perimeters, behind control joints, and at openings and penetrations with a continuous bead of acoustical sealant ... both faces ... ASTM C919, ASTM C1193\" (rezime ak moso tèks egzak).\n\n6. 092116.23\n- 2.03.I (V1 p741): \"Insulation: Sound attenuation blankets.\"\n- 3.03.H (V1 p743): \"Sound-Rated Shaft Wall Assemblies: Seal gypsum board shaft walls with acoustical sealant at perimeter of each assembly where it abuts other work and at joints and penetrations within each assembly.\"\n\n7. PA JWENN\n- 072100 (V1 p426) ak 092116.23 (V1 p742) voye sou 092900 pou \"sound attenuation blanket\", men 092900 pa espesifye l: PA JWENN.\n- Tès/konsepsyon akoustik (nimewo tès STC) pou chak tip: kolòn \"TESTED ASSEMBLIES - SOUND\" vid nan A8.1.\n"},"00_indice_fuentes.txt":{"titulo":"ENDÈKS AK SOUS - ESPESIFIKASYON ENSTALASYON DRYWALL","texto":"ENDÈKS AK SOUS - ESPESIFIKASYON ENSTALASYON DRYWALL\n(lekti sèlman; fraz egzak an anglè ant gimè; paj = paj PDF la)\n\nABREVYASYON SOUS YO\n- V1    = Project Manual Volim 1 (Div. 1-14)\n- V2    = Project Manual Volim 2 (Div. 14-28, MEP) -> pa gen seksyon drywall\n- A2    = Addendum 2 Specs (repibliye 014339, 092900, 098100)\n- A3    = Addendum 3 Project Manual (repibliye 054000 ak 072100; li pa repibliye Div. 09 drywall)\n- RFI-092900 = Spec 092900 Gypsum Board revize pa RFI-092900, 13 paj (vèsyon ki pi resan 092900)\n- A8.1  = Fèy A8.1 Partition Types and Schedules, revizyon RFI-A8.1\n- A3.21 = Fèy A3.21 Ceiling Details, IFC (li rive apre; gade 16_detalles_plafon_A3.21.txt)\n\nKOTE SEKSYON YO YE\n- 092116.23 Gypsum Board Shaft Wall Assemblies ... V1 p739-744\n- 092216 Non-Structural Metal Framing ............ V1 p745-754\n- 092900 Gypsum Board ............................ V1 p755-765 / A2 p145-155 / RFI-092900 p1-13\n- 098100 Acoustic Insulation ..................... V1 p828-832 / A2 p156-161\n- 078400 Firestopping ............................ V1 p535-544\n- 078443 Joint Firestopping ...................... V1 p545-549\n- 079219 Acoustical Joint Sealants ............... V1 p562-566\n- 072100 Thermal Insulation ...................... V1 p425-431 / A3 p227-235\n- 054000 Cold-Formed Metal Framing ............... V1 p282+ / A3 p169-181\n- 014339 Mockups ................................. V1 p68-70 / A2 p5-7\n- \"092116\" (gypsum board assemblies, san .23) ... PA JWENN kòm pwòp seksyon\n\nFICHYE NAN DOSYE SA A (kreye pa travay sa a)\n01_patron_tornillos.txt\n02_ubicacion_paredes_planos.txt\n03_normas_GA216_ASTM.txt\n04_bastidor_metalico_092216.txt\n05_RC1_resilient_channel.txt\n06_shaft_wall.txt\n07_fire_rated_2h_UL_GA.txt\n08_acabado_niveles_tolerancias.txt\n09_juntas_de_control.txt\n10_firestopping_fire_caulking.txt\n11_deflection_head_of_wall.txt\n12_aislamiento_acustico.txt\n13_blocking_refuerzos.txt\n14_submittals_mockups.txt\n15_placa_yeso_materiales_instalacion.txt\n16_detalles_plafon_A3.21.txt\n(paredes_2h_fire_rated.txt te deja la; travay sa a pa t kreye l ni chanje l)\n\nPRENSIPAL BAGAY KI MANKE (gade chak fichye)\n- Patwon vis bò/mitan pou chak kouch: PA JWENN (voye sou UL / GA-600 / GA-216 / C840)\n- Nimewo konsepsyon UL/GA miray ki gen rating yo: PA JWENN (kolòn vid nan A8.1; \"UL ###\" nan beton)\n- Tèm \"RC1\" / \"RC-1\" pou resilient channel: PA JWENN (RC-1 nan V2 p113 se \"Roof Curb, Type 1\")\n- Plan etaj ak kote chak tip miray ye: PA JWENN (pa gen plan nan dosye a)\n- Detay head-of-wall / top-of-wall (kolòn \"T.O. WALL DETAIL\" nan A8.1 vid): PA JWENN\n"},"01_patron_tornillos.txt":{"titulo":"PATWON AK ESPAS VIS","texto":"PATWON AK ESPAS VIS\n\n1. TIP VIS (092900 2.3.C; V1 p760 / RFI-092900 p6)\n- \"ASTM C1002, Type S or Type A; bugle head; self drilling and self tapping screws for light gauge steel framing (less than 0.033 inch thick).\"\n- \"ASTM C954; bugle head; self-drilling and self tapping screws for heavy gauge steel framing (0.033 inch to 0.112 inch thick).\"\n- \"ASTM C1002 Type W or Type A; bugle head; provide sufficient length to provide a minimum 3/4 inch penetration into wood framing members.\"\n- Plak sound damping (092900 2.2.E.2.b; V1 p760 / RFI-092900 p6): \"ASTM C1002 Type S or S12 fine thread drywall screws.\"\n- Shaft wall (092116.23 2.06.C; V1 p742): \"Steel Drill Screws: ASTM C 1002 unless otherwise indicated.\"\n- Cement board (092900 2.5.B.1; V1 p761 / RFI-092900 p7): \"Screws: No. 6 gauge by sufficient length to penetrate 3/4 inch into wood framing and 3/8 inch into steel framing, self-drilling, ribbed wafer head or bugle head screws; minimum 500 hour corrosion resistant finish per ASTM B117.\"\n\n2. ESPAS YO JWENN\n- Règ jeneral (092900 3.3.F; V1 p762 / RFI-092900 p8): \"Use screws to fasten gypsum board to framing.\"\n- Miray ki gen rating (092900 3.4.A; V1 p763 / RFI-092900 p9): \"Install fire rated assemblies using materials, application methods including types and spacing of fasteners, and framing in accordance with the specified UL Fire Resistive Design Number, GA-600 File Number, or CBC Table 720.\"\n- Sound damping (092900 3.5.D; V1 p763 / RFI-092900 p9): \"Secure gypsum board to metal framing using fine thread drywall screws at 16 inches on center, minimum.\"\n- Cement board (092900 3.7.D; V1 p764 / RFI-092900 p10): \"Space fasteners maximum 8 inches on center with perimeter fasteners at least 3/8 inch from ends and 5/8 inch from edges.\"\n- Cement board (092900 3.7.E): \"Drive screws so bottoms of heads are flush with surface of boards ... Do not overdrive screws and replace any screws that are stripped.\"\n- Gypsum sheathing (092900 3.6.D; V1 p763 / RFI-092900 p10): \"Do not countersink fasteners. Fasteners must be located at least 3/8 inches from edges and ends of sheathing panels.\"\n- Cant panels nan shaft (092116.23 3.03.I.1; V1 p743): \"secure top edges to shaft walls at 24 inches o.c. with screws fastened to shaft wall framing.\"\n- Finisyon (092900 3.8.C; V1 p764): \"Set mechanical fasteners below the plane of the board.\"\n\n- A3.21 detalle 2E: \"2 1/4\" DIA SS SELF TAPPING SCREW @ 12\" O.C. - VERIFY W/ MANUF.\" (nan koneksyon header / kad pòt H.M., pa plak).\n\n3. PA JWENN\n- Espas vis sou BÒ ak nan MITAN pou plak jips estanda / Type X: PA JWENN.\n- Espas pou chak KOUCH (1ye kouch / kouch fas) nan sistèm plizyè kouch: PA JWENN.\n- Longè vis espesifik (1\", 1-5/8\", elatriye) pou plak sou asye: PA JWENN\n  (sèlman penetrasyon minimòm 3/4\" nan bwa ak 3/8\" nan asye pou cement board).\n- Distans minimòm vis la ak bò a pou plak jips (pa sheathing ni cement board): PA JWENN.\n- Sa ki manke: nimewo konsepsyon UL/GA chak miray (pou li patwon vis la nan lis la) oswa tablo GA-216 / ASTM C840 (dokiman deyò, pa enkli).\n"},"02_ubicacion_paredes_planos.txt":{"titulo":"KOTE MIRAY YO YE / TIP SEPARASYON (FÈY A8.1, rev. RFI-A8.1","texto":"KOTE MIRAY YO YE / TIP SEPARASYON (FÈY A8.1, rev. RFI-A8.1\n\n1. NÒT JENERAL (A8.1, General Notes; transkripsyon egzak)\n- N1: \"ALL STANDARD STUD FRAMING SHALL BE 16\" O.C. UNO; ALL SHAFT WALL STUD FRAMING SHALL BE 24\" O.C. UNO.\"\n- N2: \"FIRE RATING AS INDICATED ON CODE PLANS.\"\n- N3: \"ALL GYP. BD. TO BE 5/8\" THICK TYPE 'X' UNO; PAINT ALL EXPOSED FACES.\"\n- N4: \"PROVIDE TYPE 'X' GLASS-MAT WATER-RESISTANT BACKER BOARD IN LIEU OF FINAL LAYER OF GYP.BD. WHERE INDICATED ON SCHEDULED WALL TYPES AT INTERIOR FRAMED WET WALLS, INCLUDING SHOWER ENCLOSURES, JANITOR'S CLOSETS, AND AT NON-FIRE RATED AND NON-ACOUSTICAL WALLS AT BATHTUB ENCLOSURES.\"\n- N5: \"PROVIDE MOISTURE AND MOLD-RESISTANT TYPE 'X' GYP. BD. AT ALL INTERIOR \"HUMID\" LOCATIONS INCLUDING BATHROOMS\"\n- N6: \"THE WALL TYPE ABOVE OR BELOW ANY OPENING IS TO BE THE SAME AS THAT SCHEDULED FOR EITHER SIDE OF THE OPENING\"\n- N7: \"DIFFERING WALL TYPES SHALL ALIGN SO THAT WALL PLANES CONTINUE UNBROKEN IN ROOMS, U.O.N.\"\n- N8: \"DIMENSION LOCATION FOR ALL INTERIOR WALLS IS TO THE FACE OF GYPSUM BOARD PANELS. WALLS INDICATED AS FIRE-RATED FORM A SEPARATION THAT SHALL BE CONTINUOUS FROM FLOOR TO FLOOR ABOVE WITH NO BREAKS AT COLUMNS, BEAMS, WALL TRANSITIONS, OR OTHER OBSTRUCTIONS. AT RATED CONDITIONS PENETRATIONS SHALL BE FIRE CAULKED.\"\n- N10: \"STUDS TO BE 25 GA AT ALL SINGLE-STUD ACOUSTICAL WALLS U.O.N. USE KNURLED STUDS OR ADJUST SPACING AS REQUIRED FOR SPANS. SPACING SHALL BE NO LESS THAN 16\" O.C. WITHOUT APPROVAL OF THE ARCHITECT. HEAVIER GAUGE MAY BE USED AT NON-ACOUSTICAL OR DOUBLE-STUD WALLS. MAXIMUM SPANS SHALL BE BASED ON L/240 DEFLECTION CRITERIA AND 5 PSF DESIGN LOAD, U.O.N.\"\n- N13: \"WALL SUPPORTING CASEWORK, SHELVING, GRAB BARS, EQUIPMENT AND OTHER WALL-MOUNTED FIXTURES SHALL BE RINFORCED PER THE FIXTURE MANUFACTURER'S REQUIREMENTS AND THE REQUIREMENTS OF THE LATEST EDITION OF THE [KÒD KONSTRIKSYON ETA A], WHICHEVER IS GREATER.\"\n- (N9, N11, N12 nan 12_aislamiento_acustico.txt ak 10_firestopping_fire_caulking.txt)\n\n2. KIJAN POU LI ETIKÈT LA (A8.1 \"Partition Type Descriptions\", egz. SA.3.10)\n- Material: S = steel (metal studs); W = wood studs; H = shaft walls; M = masonry; C = concrete\n- Rating/wotè: A = full height/underside of struct (not rated); B = 6\" above ceiling; C = underside of ceiling; D = partial height; S = smoke partition; Y = variable height; 0 = 0 hour (corridor); 5 = 0.5 h; 1 = 1 h; 2 = 2 h; 3 = 3 h; 4 = 4 h\n- Lajè: 1 = 1 5/8\" metal; 2 = 2 1/2\" metal; 3 = 3 5/8\" metal; 4 = 4\" metal; 6 = 6\" metal; 8 = 8\" metal; 10/12 beton/CMU; D = double stud; S = staggered stud; Y = non-standard; F = furring strips/channels\n- Endikatè GWB (\"NOT INCLUDING SHAFT LINER\"): 0 = no GWB; 1 = one layer, tag side; 2 = one layer, each side; 3 = two layers tag side, one layer other; 4 = two layers, each side; 5 = two layers tag side, no GWB other; 6 = three layers, each side\n- Kondisyon inik: 0 = none; 1 = load bearing [stud]; 2 = sound attenuation blanket; 3 = resilient channels w/ sound attenuation blanket; 4 = tile backer board to receive tile finish; 5 = [concrete] wall w/ corrugated metal formwork; 6 = typical framing @ underside of joist; 7 = [concrete] wall w/ corrugated metal formwork and resilient channel w/ GWB finish on stair side; 8 = tile backer board w/ air and vapor barrier\n\n3. TIP KI NAN TABLO A8.1 (mak / epesè total / rating / STC / kòmantè)\n- SA-X-1X san rating: SA-1-10, SA-1-16, SA-3-10, SA-3-12 (4 1/4\"), SA-3-18 (4 1/4\"), SA-6-10 / SA-6-12 / SA-6-18 (6 5/8\") - NR\n- SA-X-2X san rating: SA-3-20 / SA-3-22 / SA-3-28 (4 7/8\"), SA-6-20 / SA-6-22 / SA-6-28 (7 1/4\"), SD-3-20 (4 7/8\") - NR\n- S1-X-2X 1 èdtan: S1-3-10 (4 1/4\"), S1-3-20 (4 7/8\"), S1-3-23 (11 3/4\", STC 64, \"RESIDENTIAL / FITNESS SEPARATION\"), S1-6-13 (7 1/8\", STC 56, \"TYPICAL CORRIDOR / DEMISING\"), S1-6-20 (7 1/4\"), S1-6-22 (7 1/4\"), S1-6-23 (7 3/4\", STC 56, \"TYPICAL CORRIDOR / DEMISING\"), S1-6-42 (8 1/2\"), S1-8-20 (9 1/4\")\n- S2-X-4X 2 èdtan: S2-3-40 (6 1/8\"), S2-6-40 (8 1/2\"), S2-6-41 (8 1/2\") - rating 2\n- H2-X-3X 2 èdtan shaft: H2-4-30 (6 1/4\"), H2-6-30 (7 1/4\") - rating 2; desen: \"C-H METAL STUD FRAMING\", \"1\" GYPSUM SHAFT LINER\"\n- Masonri: M0-8-00, M1-8-00, M2-8-00, M4-8-00 (7 5/8\")\n- Beton: CA-6-00, CA-12-00 (NR); C2-6-00, C2-8-00, C2-10-00, C2-10-07, C2-11-05, C2-11-07, C2-12-00, C2-18-00 (rating 2)\n- Detay sou fèy la: \"DETAIL AT SHAFT WALLS\", \"ELEVATOR SHAFT DETAIL\", \"ELEVATOR SHAFT DETAIL @ SHEAR WALL\" (echèl 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"); nòt nan detay shaft: \"NO LIMITING HEIGHT IF BRACED TO ADJACENT CONSTRUCTION\"; \"FIRE PROTECTION SPRINKLER HEAD @ ALTERNATING FLOORS AND TOP OF SHAFT, TYP.\"\n\n4. PA JWENN\n- Plan / plan etaj ak kote chak tip miray ye: PA JWENN (se sèlman A8.1 ki nan dosye a; anplis N2 voye sou \"CODE PLANS\", ki pa enkli).\n- Kolòn \"TESTED ASSEMBLIES\", \"T.O. WALL DETAIL\", \"B.O. WALL DETAIL\": vid (selil jòn vid) nan tablo studs ak shaft yo.\n- Nòt fèy A8.1 yo pa nan spec 092900/092216 (egz. 25 GA, 24\" o.c. shaft) -> sèlman nan A8.1.\n"},"03_normas_GA216_ASTM.txt":{"titulo":"NÒM YO SITE (GA, ASTM, UL, CBC/[kòd eta a])","texto":"NÒM YO SITE (GA, ASTM, UL, CBC/[kòd eta a])\n\n1. 092900 GYPSUM BOARD - 1.2 REFERENCES (V1 p756-757 / RFI-092900 p2-3)\n- \"ASTM C840 - Standard Specification for Application and Finishing of Gypsum Board.\"\n- \"ASTM C954 - Standard Specification for Steel Drill Screws ... to Steel Studs From 0.033 in. (0.84 mm) to 0.112 in. (2.84 mm) in Thickness.\"\n- \"ASTM C1002 - Standard Specification for Steel Self-Piercing Tapping Screws for the Application of Gypsum Panel Products or Metal Plaster Bases to Wood Studs or Steel Studs.\"\n- \"ASTM C1047 - Standard Specification for Accessories for Gypsum Wallboard and Gypsum Veneer Base.\"\n- \"ASTM C1396/C1396M - Standard Specification for Gypsum Board.\"\n- \"ASTM C475/C475M\" (joint compound/tape); C473; C1177; C1278; C1325; D3273; E695; B117; D226; D1117; D2103; E96; ANSI A108.11, A118.1, A118.4, A118.9\n- \"GA-214 - Recommended Levels of Gypsum Board Finish.\"\n- \"GA-216 - Application and Finishing of Gypsum Board.\"\n- \"GA-253 - Application of Gypsum Sheathing.\"\n- \"GA-600 - Fire Resistance Design Manual.\"\n- \"UL Fire Resistance Directory.\"\n- 1.4.B (V1 p757): \"Regulatory Requirements: Comply with requirements of CBC Chapter 25.\"\n\n2. KOTE YO APLIKE NAN 092900\n- 3.3.A (V1 p762 / RFI-092900 p8): \"Install gypsum board to framing and furring members in accordance with manufacturer's recommendations, GA-216 or ASTM C840, and as specified in this Section.\"\n- 3.4.A (V1 p763 / RFI-092900 p9): \"... in accordance with the specified UL Fire Resistive Design Number, GA-600 File Number, or CBC Table 720.\"\n- 3.5.A (V1 p763): \"Install sound damping gypsum board in accordance with GA-201, GA-216, GA-600, and manufacturer's instructions.\"\n- 3.5.C (V1 p763): \"Comply with ASTM C919 ...\"\n- 3.6.A: \"Install gypsum sheathing in accordance with GA-253 and manufacturer's instructions.\"\n- 3.8.A (V1 p764 / RFI-092900 p10): \"Finish gypsum board surfaces in accordance with ASTM C840, GA-214 and GA-216.\"\n- RFI-092900 3.8.G (p10): \"Finish gypsum board in accordance with levels defined in ASTM C840, as follows:\"\n\n3. 092216 NON-STRUCTURAL METAL FRAMING\n- 2.03.A (V1 p747): \"Framing Members, General: Comply with ASTM C 754 for conditions indicated.\"\n- 2.03.A.1-2: \"Comply with ASTM C 645 requirements for metal\" ; \"Protective Coating: ASTM A 653/A 653M, G40, hot-dip galvanized unless otherwise indicated.\"\n- 3.03.A (V1 p751): \"Installation Standard: ASTM C 754.\" / \"Gypsum Board Assemblies: Also comply with requirements in ASTM C 840 that apply to framing installation.\"\n- 2.02.A-B (V1 p746): dife \"ASTM E 119\"; STC \"ASTM E 90 and classified according to ASTM E 413\".\n- 1.03.B.1 (V1 p746): sètifikasyon SIFA \"Code Compliance Certification Program for Cold-Formed Steel Structural and Non-Structural Framing Members.\"\n- Firestop top track seal (V1 p749): \"UL 2079 tested\"; ASTM E84; ASTM G21.\n\n4. 092116.23 SHAFT WALL\n- 1.06.A (V1 p740): \"Comply with ASTM C 840 requirements or with gypsum board manufacturer's written recommendations, whichever are more stringent.\"\n- 3.03.A (V1 p743): \"... manufacturer's written installation instructions, and ASTM C 754 other than stud-spacing requirements.\"\n- 2.04 (V1 p741): shaftliner \"ASTM C 1396/C 1396M\" ak \"ASTM C 1658/C 1658M\"; kanni \"ASTM D 3273 ... ASTM D 3274\".\n- 2.06.C (V1 p742): \"ASTM C 1002\"; ankraj ASTM E 488 / ASTM E 1190.\n\n5. LÒT\n- 078400 (V1 p538-539): ASTM E2307, ASTM E2837, ASTM E1966, UL 2079, ASTM E814, UL 1479; enspeksyon ASTM E 2174 / ASTM E 2393 (p542).\n- 078443 (V1 p547-549): ASTM E1966 oswa UL 2079; ASTM E84; ASTM E2393.\n- 079219 (V1 p564-565): ASTM E90, ASTM C834, ASTM C919, ASTM C1193.\n- A8.1 N12: \"[kòd eta a] 2015, SECTION 706.\" ; N13: \"[KÒD KONSTRIKSYON ETA A]\".\n- Obsèvasyon (san entèprete): 092900 site \"CBC Chapter 25\" ak \"CBC Table 720\"; A8.1 site [kòd eta a] 2015 / [kòd konstriksyon eta a].\n\n6. PA JWENN\n- Tèks GA-216, GA-600, ASTM C840, C754 (dokiman deyò; yo pa nan dosye a).\n- \"File Number\" GA-600 espesifik pou chak miray: PA JWENN.\n"},"06_shaft_wall.txt":{"titulo":"SHAFT WALL - SEKSYON 092116.23 GYPSUM BOARD SHAFT WALL ASSEMBLIES (V1 p739-744) + A8.1","texto":"SHAFT WALL - SEKSYON 092116.23 GYPSUM BOARD SHAFT WALL ASSEMBLIES (V1 p739-744) + A8.1\n\n1. ASANBLAJ (2.03, p740-741)\n- \"Fire-Resistance Rating: As indicated.\" / \"STC Rating: As indicated.\"\n- Studs: \"Manufacturer's standard profile for repetitive members, corner and end members, and fire-resistance-rated assembly indicated.\" ; \"Depth: As indicated.\" ; \"Minimum Base-Metal Thickness: 0.018 inch.\"\n- Runner: \"Manufacturer's standard J-profile track with manufacturer's standard long-leg length, but at least 2 inches long and matching studs in depth.\"\n- \"Firestop Tracks: Provide firestop track at head of shaft wall on each floor level.\"\n- Asansè: \"J-profile jamb strut with long-leg length of 3 inches, matching studs in depth, and not less than 0.033 inch thick.\"\n- \"Room-Side Finish: Gypsum board.\"\n- Shaft-side: \"Typical: Gypsum shaftliner board, moisture- and mold-resistant Type X.\" / \"Extended Outdoor Exposure: Gypsum shaftliner board, extended exposure Type X.\"\n- \"Insulation: Sound attenuation blankets.\"\n- Shaftliner (2.04.B-C, p741): \"Thickness: 1 inch.\" ; \"Long Edges: Double bevel.\" ; \"Mold Resistance: ASTM D 3273, score of 10\"; extended exposure: \"Able to withstand up to 12 months of outdoor weather exposure.\"\n- Vis (2.06.C, p742): \"Steel Drill Screws: ASTM C 1002 unless otherwise indicated.\"\n- Akoustik (2.06.F): \"Acoustical Sealant: As specified in Section 079219\".\n\n2. ENSTALASYON (3.03, p742-743)\n- \"Install gypsum board shaft wall assemblies to comply with requirements of fire-resistance-rated assemblies indicated, manufacturer's written installation instructions, and ASTM C 754 other than stud-spacing requirements.\"\n- \"Do not bridge building expansion joints with shaft wall assemblies; frame both sides of expansion joints with furring and other support.\"\n- \"Elevator Hoistway: At elevator hoistway-entrance door frames, provide jamb struts on each side of door frame.\"\n- Rampla: \"provide galvanized steel reinforcing strip with 0.033-inch minimum thickness of base metal (uncoated), accurately positioned and secured behind at least one layer of face panel.\"\n- Pèsaj: \"maintain fire-resistance rating ... by installing supplementary steel framing around perimeter of penetration and fire protection behind boxes containing wiring devices, elevator call buttons, elevator floor indicators, and similar items.\"\n- \"Isolate perimeter of gypsum panels from building structure to prevent cracking of panels, while maintaining continuity of fire-rated construction.\"\n- \"Firestop Tracks: Where indicated, install to maintain continuity of fire-resistance-rated assembly indicated.\"\n- \"Control Joints: Install control joints according to ASTM C 840 and in specific locations approved by Architect while maintaining fire-resistance rating\"\n- \"Sound-Rated Shaft Wall Assemblies: Seal gypsum board shaft walls with acoustical sealant at perimeter of each assembly where it abuts other work and at joints and penetrations within each assembly.\"\n- Cant panels: \"At projections into shaft exceeding 4 inches ... install 1/2- or 5/8-inch- thick gypsum board cants\" ; \"Slope cant panels at least 75 degrees from horizontal\" ; \"secure top edges to shaft walls at 24 inches o.c. with screws\" ; framing sipò \"at 24 inches o.c.\"\n- \"Installation Tolerance: Install each framing member so fastening surfaces vary not more than 1/8 inch from the plane formed by faces of adjacent framing.\"\n- Fireproofing (3.02): pa diminye epesè SFRM \"below that which is required to obtain fire-resistance rating indicated.\"\n- Defleksyon shaft (092216 2.02.C, V1 p746): \"Shaft Walls at HVAC Shafts: 10 lbf/sq. ft.\" / \"Shaft Walls at Elevator Shafts: 10 lbf/sq. ft.\"\n\n3. A8.1\n- N1: \"ALL SHAFT WALL STUD FRAMING SHALL BE 24\" O.C. UNO.\"\n- H2-X-3X 2-HOUR RATED SHAFT PARTITIONS: H2-4-30 (6 1/4\"), H2-6-30 (7 1/4\"), rating 2.\n- Endikatè GWB 3: \"TWO LAYERS TAG SIDE, ONE LAYER OTHER\" (pa gen shaft liner ladan); desen: \"C-H METAL STUD FRAMING\", \"1\" GYPSUM SHAFT LINER\", sound attenuation blanket.\n- N11.g: miray akoustik yo gen ladan \"SHAFT WALLS AT UNITS\".\n- Detay: \"DETAIL AT SHAFT WALLS\", \"ELEVATOR SHAFT DETAIL\", \"ELEVATOR SHAFT DETAIL @ SHEAR WALL\"; nòt \"NO LIMITING HEIGHT IF BRACED TO ADJACENT CONSTRUCTION\".\n\n4. PA JWENN\n- Konsepsyon UL/GA shaft H2 a (kolòn \"TESTED ASSEMBLIES\" vid): PA JWENN.\n- Patwon/espas vis pou chak kouch nan shaft: PA JWENN.\n- Wotè maksimòm / kalib pa wotè C-H studs: PA JWENN.\n- Submittal shop drawings pou shaft: PA JWENN (sèlman product data ak ICC-ES).\n"},"07_fire_rated_2h_UL_GA.txt":{"titulo":"MIRAY FIRE-RATED (1 h / 2 h) - UL / GA / CBC","texto":"MIRAY FIRE-RATED (1 h / 2 h) - UL / GA / CBC\n\n1. EGZIJANS JENERAL\n- 092900 3.4.A (V1 p763 / RFI-092900 p9): \"Install fire rated assemblies using materials, application methods including types and spacing of fasteners, and framing in accordance with the specified UL Fire Resistive Design Number, GA-600 File Number, or CBC Table 720.\"\n- 092900 3.4.B: \"Completely seal joints of fire-rated gypsum board enclosures in accordance with UL or GA listed assembly requirements. Seal penetrations through rated partitions and ceilings in accordance with tested systems. Refer to Section 078400.\"\n- 092216 2.02.A (V1 p746): \"provide materials and construction identical to those tested in assembly indicated, according to ASTM E 119 by an independent testing agency.\"\n- 092216 3.04.D.4 (V1 p752): \"Fire-Resistance-Rated Partitions: Install framing to comply with fire-resistance-rated assembly indicated and support closures and to make partitions continuous from floor to underside of solid structure.\"\n- 092216 3.05.D (V1 p754): \"Fire-Resistance-Rated Assemblies: Wire tie furring channels to supports.\"\n- 092116.23 2.02.A (V1 p740): \"provide materials and construction identical to those tested in assembly indicated according to ASTM E 119\".\n- 092900 3.2.A (V1 p761 / RFI-092900 p8): \"Install intumescent moldable pads over backs and sides of all electrical junction and utility boxes at fire rated walls.\"\n- 092900 2.3.B: control joints \"provided in accordance with UL fire rated assemblies.\"\n\n2. PLAK\n- 092900 2.2.A: \"Type X: ASTM C1396/1396M; 5/8-inch thick; fire resistant core\"\n- A8.1 N3: \"ALL GYP. BD. TO BE 5/8\" THICK TYPE 'X' UNO\"\n- RFI-092900 3.3.A.1 (p8): \"Install type X gypsum board at corridors.\" (V1 p762 ak A2 p152 te di \"Install hi-impact gypsum board at corridors.\")\n\n3. TIP KI GEN RATING NAN A8.1\n- 1 h: S1-3-10, S1-3-20, S1-3-23, S1-6-13, S1-6-20, S1-6-22, S1-6-23, S1-6-42, S1-8-20; M1-8-00\n- 2 h studs: S2-3-40 (6 1/8\"), S2-6-40 (8 1/2\"), S2-6-41 (8 1/2\") -> endikatè 4 = \"TWO LAYERS, EACH SIDE\"; modifikatè 1 sou S2-6-41 = load bearing stud\n- 2 h shaft: H2-4-30 (6 1/4\"), H2-6-30 (7 1/4\") -> endikatè 3 = \"TWO LAYERS TAG SIDE, ONE LAYER OTHER\" + 1\" shaft liner\n- 2 h masonri/beton: M2-8-00; C2-6-00 ... C2-18-00\n- 4 h: M4-8-00\n- A8.1 N8: \"WALLS INDICATED AS FIRE-RATED FORM A SEPARATION THAT SHALL BE CONTINUOUS FROM FLOOR TO FLOOR ABOVE WITH NO BREAKS AT COLUMNS, BEAMS, WALL TRANSITIONS, OR OTHER OBSTRUCTIONS. AT RATED CONDITIONS PENETRATIONS SHALL BE FIRE CAULKED.\"\n- A8.1 N2: \"FIRE RATING AS INDICATED ON CODE PLANS.\"\n- A8.1 lejand: \"SPRAY APPLIED FIREPROOFING (UL VERIFICATION BY COLD-FORMED METAL FRAMING SUBCONTRACTOR\"\n\n4. NIMEWO KONSEPSYON\n- UL design (U4xx, V4xx, W4xx, elatriye): PA JWENN nan okenn sous.\n- GA-600 File Number: PA JWENN.\n- CBC Table 720 item: PA JWENN.\n- A8.1: kolòn \"TESTED ASSEMBLIES\" vid pou S1, S2, H2; nan kèk liy beton C2 se sèlman mak \"UL ###\" ki parèt (san nimewo).\n\n5. PA JWENN / SA KI MANKE\n- Plan kòd (\"CODE PLANS\") ak kote miray ki gen rating yo ye: yo pa nan dosye a.\n- Patwon vis pou chak kouch pou 2 h: depann de konsepsyon UL/GA ki pa endike a.\n"},"09_juntas_de_control.txt":{"titulo":"JWEN KONTWÒL","texto":"JWEN KONTWÒL\n\n1. PWODWI (092900 2.3.B; V1 p760 / RFI-092900 p6)\n- \"Control Joints: ASTM C1047; roll-formed zinc joint with removable protected opening; provided in accordance with UL fire rated assemblies.\" (pwodwi fabrikan an retire)\n\n2. KOTE MINIMÒM (092900 3.3.I; V1 p762 / RFI-092900 p8-9)\n- \"Install consistent with lines of building spaces and as a minimum, install as follows:\"\n- \"Where a partition, wall, or ceiling traverses a construction joint (expansion, seismic, or building control element) in the base building structure.\"\n- \"Where a wall or partition runs in an uninterrupted straight plane exceeding 30 linear feet.\"\n- \"In interior ceilings with perimeter relief so that linear dimensions between control joints do not exceed 50 feet and total area between control joints does not exceed 2500 square feet.\"\n- \"In interior ceilings without perimeter relief so that linear dimensions between control joints do not exceed 30 feet and total area between control joints does not exceed 900 square feet.\"\n- \"In exterior ceilings and soffits so that linear dimensions between control joints do not exceed 30 feet and total area between control joints do not exceed 900 square feet.\"\n- \"Where ceiling framing members change direction.\"\n- \"Where a partition transitions from floor-supported framing to overhead hung framing.\"\n\n3. KI GEN RAPÒ\n- 092216 3.03.E (V1 p751): \"Do not bridge building control and expansion joints with non-load-bearing steel framing members. Frame both sides of joints independently.\"\n- 092216 3.04.D.2.b (V1 p752): cripple studs \"with a minimum 1/2-inch clearance from jamb stud to allow for installation of control joint in finished assembly.\"\n- 092116.23 3.03.G (V1 p743): \"Install control joints according to ASTM C 840 and in specific locations approved by Architect while maintaining fire-resistance rating of gypsum board shaft wall assemblies.\"\n- 092900 3.5.C: sele \"behind control joints\" ak silikòn akoustik.\n\n- A3.21 (plafon): detay 1A, 1B \"CONTROL JOINT\"; 1C \"1\" EJ\" + \"CONT EXP JT COVER\"; 2A/2B \"SUSPEND GYPSUM CEILING CONTROL JOINT\" ak \"4\" MAX.\" ak \"1/4\"\". Gade 16_detalles_plafon_A3.21.txt.\n\n4. PA JWENN\n- Kote jwen kontwòl yo ye sou plan/elevasyon: PA JWENN.\n- Detay jwen kontwòl nan miray ki gen rating (sipò, firestop dèyè jwen an): PA JWENN.\n"},"10_firestopping_fire_caulking.txt":{"titulo":"FIRESTOPPING / FIRE CAULKING / SISTÈM JWEN","texto":"FIRESTOPPING / FIRE CAULKING / SISTÈM JWEN\n\n1. A8.1\n- N8: \"AT RATED CONDITIONS PENETRATIONS SHALL BE FIRE CAULKED.\"\n- N12: \"PROVIDE FIRE-RESISTIVE JOINT SYSTEM BETWEEN FIRE-RESISTIVE WALLS AND FIRE-RESISTIVE FLOORS OR FIRE-RESISTIVE CEILINGS PER REQUIREMENTS OF [kòd eta a] 2015, SECTION 706.\"\n\n2. 092900\n- 3.1.F (V1 p761 / RFI-092900 p8): \"Verify firestopping work, refer to Section 078400.\"\n- 3.2.A: \"Install intumescent moldable pads over backs and sides of all electrical junction and utility boxes at fire rated walls.\"\n- 2.3.H (V1 p760): putty pads \"7.25 inches by 7.25 inches\" oswa \"9 inches by 9 inches\" (pwodwi a retire).\n- 3.4.B (V1 p763): \"Completely seal joints of fire-rated gypsum board enclosures in accordance with UL or GA listed assembly requirements.\"\n\n3. 092216 (V1 p748-749)\n- Firestop top track seal: \"One-piece, pre-formed, polyurethane foam based, firestop seal for use with standard head-joint top tracks and bottom-joint tracks, and slip-type head joints in fire-rated construction\"\n- \"Use only firestop top track seal product that has been UL 2079 tested for specific fire-rated construction conditions\"\n- \"Movement: +/- 50 percent.\" ; ASTM E84 \"Flame Spread: 10; Smoke Development: 20\" ; ASTM G21 \"Class 0\" ; \"VOC Content: 0.18 lb./gallon maximum.\"\n- 3.04.D.4.b (p752): \"Firestop Track Seals: Install to maintain continuity of fire-resistance-rated assembly indicated. Install in accordance with the firestop manufacturer's printed installation instructions.\"\n\n4. 078400 FIRESTOPPING (V1 p535-544)\n- 1.02.A.4: gen ladan \"Gaps between the top of walls and ceilings or roof assemblies.\"\n- 2.03.B (p538): \"Head-of-Wall Firestopping at Joints Between Non-Rated Floor and Fire-Rated Wall: Use any system that has been tested according to ASTM E2837 to have fire resistance F Rating equal to required fire rating of floor or wall, whichever is greater.\"\n- 2.03.C: jwen kote toude gen rating: \"tested according to ASTM E1966 or UL 2079\"\n- 2.03.D: pèsaj: \"ASTM E814 or UL 1479\"\n- 2.03.F (p539): jwen nan smoke barriers \"L Rating not exceeding 5.0 cfm/linear. ft.\"\n- 1.04.C (p536): submittal \"Schedule of Firestopping ... design designation of qualified testing and inspecting agency\"; engineering judgments ak apwobasyon AHJ.\n- 3.03.D (p541): \"Do not cover installed firestopping until inspected by field quality control service and authority having jurisdiction.\"\n- 3.04.A (p541): make miray yo \"FIRE AND/OR SMOKE BARRIER - PROTECT ALL OPENINGS,\" lèt \"not less than 3 inches high\"; \"at 15 feet from end of wall and at intervals not exceeding 30 feet.\"\n- 3.05.A (p542): enspeksyon \"ASTM E 2174 ... and ASTM E 2393\"\n- 3.08 (p542-544): tablo sistèm UL; \"HW\" = Head of Wall; \"SYSTEMS PROVIDED BELOW ARE FOR GUIDANCE ONLY\".\n\n5. 078443 JOINT FIRESTOPPING (V1 p545-549)\n- 2.2.B (p547): \"Provide joint firestopping systems with ratings determined per ASTM E1966 or UL 2079.\"\n- 2.2.B.2 (p548): \"Fire-Resistance Rating: Equal to or exceeding the fire-resistance rating of the wall, floor, or roof in or between which it is installed.\"\n- 1.6.A (p546): enstalatè apwouve FM 4991 oswa UL Qualified Firestop Contractor.\n- 3.4.A (p549): enspeksyon \"according to ASTM E2393.\"\n\n6. PA JWENN\n- Nimewo sistèm UL espesifik (HW-D-xxxx, W-L-xxxx) pou chak kondisyon pwojè sa a: PA JWENN.\n- Detay grafik head-of-wall ki gen rating: PA JWENN.\n"},"14_submittals_mockups.txt":{"titulo":"SUBMITTALS AK MOCK-UPS","texto":"SUBMITTALS AK MOCK-UPS\n\n1. 092900 (V1 p757 / RFI-092900 p3)\n- Product data.\n- \"Submit two 2 foot by 2 foot samples of spray-applied texture finish.\"\n- Enstalatè: eksperyans 5 pwojè nan 3 an (rezime).\n- \"Comply with requirements of CBC Chapter 25.\"\n\n2. 092216 (V1 p746)\n- Product data; sètifikasyon SIFA; firestop tracks ak seals; smoke/acoustic seals.\n- Delegated design: \"to frame openings over 4 feet in width ... structural calculations ... signed, and sealed\" (moso).\n- Evaluation reports ICC-ES.\n\n3. 092116.23 (V1 p740)\n- Product data; rapò ICC-ES pou shaft walls ak firestop tracks.\n\n4. 078400 / 078443 (V1 p536, p546)\n- Product data; schedule ak deziyasyon UL; engineering judgments AHJ apwouve; test reports; konpatibilite; sètifika enstalatè; schedule firestopping ki enstale.\n\n5. 098100 (A2 p156)\n- Product data ak \"installation procedures\".\n\n6. 079219 (V1 p562-563)\n- Product data ak samples.\n\n7. MOCK-UPS - 014339 (A2 p5-7)\n- \"(1) standard and (1) ADA Type A Unit on the lowest residential floors\"\n- \"Mockup to be complete and ready for review, no later than 2 months prior to material installation\"\n- Avi 7 jou anvan; revizyon 7 jou.\n- \"See mockup details on Architectural Drawings.\"\n\n8. PA JWENN\n- Mock-up espesifik pou drywall/framing/finisyon nan 092216, 092900 oswa 092116.23: PA JWENN.\n- Shop drawings drywall: PA JWENN kòm egzijans (sèlman delegated design pou ouvèti >4 ft).\n- Plan achitekti detay mockup: PA JWENN nan dosye a.\n"},"15_placa_yeso_materiales_instalacion.txt":{"titulo":"PLAK JIPS - MATERYÈL AK ENSTALASYON (092900; RFI-092900 = vèsyon an vigè)","texto":"PLAK JIPS - MATERYÈL AK ENSTALASYON (092900; RFI-092900 = vèsyon an vigè)\n\n1. PWODWI (2.2-2.3; V1 p758-760 / RFI-092900 p4-7)\n- \"Type X: ASTM C1396/1396M; 5/8-inch thick; fire resistant core\"\n- Moisture/mold resistant Type X 5/8\"; flexible 1/4\"; hi-impact; sound damping 5/8\"; sheathing 5/8\" Type X; cement board (rezime; mak yo retire).\n- Mullion trim caps (sèlman A2/RFI-092900): STC >= 60; vèsyon ki gen rating nan miray ki gen rating (rezime).\n- A8.1 N3: \"ALL GYP. BD. TO BE 5/8\" THICK TYPE 'X' UNO; PAINT ALL EXPOSED FACES.\"\n- A8.1 N4: glass-mat water-resistant backer Type X sou miray mouye; N5: MR Type X nan \"HUMID\" locations incl. bathrooms.\n\n2. ENSTALASYON (3.3; V1 p762 / RFI-092900 p8)\n- \"Install gypsum board to framing and furring members in accordance with manufacturer's recommendations, GA-216 or ASTM C840, and as specified in this Section.\"\n- RFI-092900 3.3.A.1: \"Install type X gypsum board at corridors.\" (V1/A2: \"hi-impact\")\n- Jwen bout yo dekale (stagger end joints).\n- \"Install 1/4 inch (nominal) above rough floor or curb.\"\n- Tout wotè a an yon sèl moso (rezime).\n- \"... undercutting board 3/8 inch (nominal) and sealing top edge to adjacent surface with a continuous bead of sealant to form an elastic closure.\"\n- Corner beads nan kwen deyò (rezime).\n\n3. VIS: gade 01_patron_tornillos.txt\n4. DIFE: gade 07_fire_rated_2h_UL_GA.txt\n5. FINISYON/TOLERANS: gade 08_acabado_niveles_tolerancias.txt\n6. JWEN KONTWÒL: gade 09_juntas_de_control.txt\n\n7. SHEATHING AK CEMENT BOARD\n- 3.6.A: \"Install gypsum sheathing in accordance with GA-253 and manufacturer's instructions.\"\n- 3.7: cement board dapre ANSI A108.11 (rezime).\n\n8. KONDISYON (1.5-1.6)\n- Tanperati minimòm 40 F; 50 F pandan 48 h pou finisyon (rezime).\n\n9. PA JWENN\n- Oryantasyon plak (orizontal/vètikal) pou chak tip miray: PA JWENN.\n- Dekalaj jwen ant kouch yo (distans): PA JWENN.\n"},"16_detalles_plafon_A3.21.txt":{"titulo":"DETAY PLAFON JIPS - FÈY A3.21 CEILING DETAILS (IFC; gen ladan Addendum 2 ak 3)","texto":"DETAY PLAFON JIPS - FÈY A3.21 CEILING DETAILS (IFC; gen ladan Addendum 2 ak 3)\n(fichye ki rive apre; 1 paj; tèks li nan PDF la epi verifye sou imaj la)\n\n1. GENERAL NOTES (A3.21)\n- N10: \"ALL WALLS EXTEND TO UNDERSIDE OF DECK EXCEPT THOSE SHOWN SHADED IN WHICH GYPSUM BOARD OR MASONRY EXTENDS MIN 4 INCHES ABOVE FINISHED CEILING. ALL METAL STUDS EXTEND TO UNDERSIDE OF FLOOR OR ROOF DECK.\"\n- N7: \"PROVIDE SUSPENSION SYSTEM AROUND ELECTRICAL FIXTURES, MECHANICAL GRILLES, DIFFUSERS, AND OTHER CEILING MOUNTED DEVICES.\"\n- N2: \"SEE SHEET SERIES A2 FOR UNIT REFLECTED CEILING PLANS.\"\n\n2. SENBÒL PLAFON (A3.21 Symbols)\n- \"GWB-1: GYPSUM CEILING ON METAL STUDS; SUSPENDED FROM RATED FLOOR/CEILING ASSEMBLY\"\n- \"GWB-2: GYPSUM CEILING TIGHT TO STRUCTURE; SEE HORIZONTAL ASSEMBLIES (SHEET A6.0)\"\n- \"GWB-3: 2HR RATED GYPSUM CEILING ON METAL STUDS\"\n- \"SPRAY APPLIED INSULATION AT UNDERSIDE OF STRUCTURE\"\n- \"CJ  CONTROL JOINT\"\n\n3. DETAY\n- 1A \"LOW GYP. TO HIGH GYP.\" (1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"): \"3 5/8\" METAL STUD BRACING @ 32\" O.C.\" ; \"3 5/8\" METAL STUDS @ 16\" O.C.\" ; \"5/8\" GWB, TYP\" ; \"SUSPENDED GYPSUM BOARD CEILING\" ; \"CONTROL JOINT\"\n- 1B (jips ba rive nan plafon wo yon lòt sistèm): \"REFER TO A6 SERIES FOR JOIST ASSEMBLY\" ; \"STEEL FRAMING\" ; \"5/8\" GWB, TYP\" ; \"3 5/8\" METAL STUDS @ 16\" O.C.\" ; \"3 5/8\" METAL STUD BRACING @ 32\" O.C.\" ; \"CONTROL JOINT\"\n- 1C \"SUSP GWB CEILING EXP JT\": \"FACE OF CMU WALL\" ; \"1\" EJ\" ; \"CONT EXP JT COVER\"\n- 1D \"TYP SUSP GWB PERIMETER JT\": \"PERIMETER CASING BEAD - HOLD OFF THE WALL TO PROVIDE 1/4\" GAP\" ; \"BACKER ROD AND SEALANT\"\n- 1E \"TYPICAL GWB CEILING\": \"SEE PLAN FOR WALL TYPE\" ; \"METAL STUDS @ 16\" O.C., DEPTH TO RESULT IN DEFLECTION OF L/240 MAX, UNO\" ; \"GWB CEILING, SEE RCP FOR HEIGHT\"\n- 2A/2B \"SUSPEND GYPSUM CEILING CONTROL JOINT\" (A = \"PERPENDICULAR TO FURRING CHANNELS\", B = \"PARALLEL TO FURRING CHANNELS\"): \"HANGER WIRE, TYP\" ; \"LOOSE WIRE TIE, TYP\" ; \"1 1/2\" SUSPENDED CHANNELS, TYP\" ; \"SHORT PIECE OF FURRING CHANNEL INVERTED FOR SPLICE\" ; \"CONTINUOUS FURRING CHANNEL\" ; \"4\" MAX.\" (chak bò) ; \"1/4\"\" (espas) ; \"1 1/2\" CHANNEL PEICE, 16\" LONG, NESTED (TWO WIRE TIES EACH SIDE)\" ; \"GYPSUM BOARD CONTROL JOINT\"\n- 2C / 2D \"CEILING ACCESS PANEL @ GYP. BD.\" (3\" = 1'-0\"): \"PANEL WIDTH + 1/4\"\" ; \"MTL STUD, TYP\" ; \"1/2\" GWB\" ; \"DRYWALL COMPOUND AROUND OPENING PERIMETER\" ; 2D: \"SOUND ATTENUATION INSULATION - STRAP TO TOP OF ACCESS PANEL\"\n- 2E \"TYP. CEILING WALL CONNECTION\" (1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"): \"BATT INSULATION\" ; \"5/8\" TYPE 'X' GYPSUM WALL BOARD\" ; \"METAL STUD BOX HEADER\" ; \"2 1/4\" DIA SS SELF TAPPING SCREW @ 12\" O.C. - VERIFY W/ MANUF.\" (fiksasyon nan kad pòt H.M.) ; \"INSULATE DOOR FRAME CAVITY\" ; \"H.M. DOOR FRAME PER SCHEDULES\"\n\n4. PA JWENN NAN A3.21\n- Nimewo konsepsyon UL plafon \"GWB-3: 2HR RATED\" la: PA JWENN.\n- Patwon vis plak sou furring/stud nan plafon: PA JWENN.\n- Espas hangers / kanal nan detay la: PA JWENN (spec 092216 3.05: 48\" / 48\" / 16\" o.c.).\n- Fèy A6.0 / seri A6 ak RCP (seri A2) yo site a: yo pa nan dosye a.\n"},"01_092900_Niveles_de_Acabado_GA-214.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – PLAK JIPS: TRETMAN JWEN AK NIVO FINISYON","texto":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – PLAK JIPS: TRETMAN JWEN AK NIVO FINISYON\n========================\nVèsyon an vigè: 092900 GYPSUM BOARD – RFI-092900 (13 paj), atik 3.8 \"Joint Treatment and Finish Texture\", paj PDF 10-11.\nIstorik: pwen 3.8.G (nivo yo ak kote yo ye ak kantite kouch) te ajoute nan RFI-092900. Tablo 3.8.H ak pwen 3.8.A-F\nte deja nan Manual V1 (paj 764-765) ak nan Addendum 2 (paj 155).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la) (vèsyon anvan yo kopye tou, make \"ranplase\").\n\n3.8 A-F – EGZIJANS JENERAL\n  A. Fini dapre ASTM C840, GA-214 ak GA-216.\n  B. Netwaye pousyè, lwil ak tout sa ki anpeche konpoze a kole.\n  C. Fonse vis yo anba plan plak la.\n  D. Mete teyp, ranpli epi ponse tout jwen, bò ak kwen jiskaske sifas la lis; ranpli kabòsman ak twou pou jwenn yon sifas monolitik.\n  E. Difize kouch konpoze yo sou sifas ki kole a: koubi (camber) maksimòm 1/32\".\n  F. \"Spray apply texture on all gypsum board surfaces, unless noted otherwise.\" (tekstil espre toupatou, sof si yo endike; gade fichye 03).\n\n3.8 G – NIVO DAPRE ASTM C840\n  Nivo 1 – Kote: zòn miray ki gen rating dife anlè plafon fini, aksesib oswa non.\n            Jwen ak ang enteryè antere nan konpoze; 1 kouch konpoze sou jwen, ang, tèt vis ak akseswa.\n            Sifas san eksè konpoze.\n  Nivo 2 – Kote: (1) asanblaj ki gen rating dife, akoustik ak lafimen nan plenums ak zòn kache; (2) zòn kache ak\n            konstriksyon ki pa endike kòm Nivo 3, 4 oswa 5. Jwen antere + 1 kouch konpoze. San eksè konpoze.\n  Nivo 3 – Kote: (1) miray ak panno FRP; (2) zòn ak tekstil lou anvan penti final la; (3) zòn ak tapi komèsyal\n            lou kòm dekorasyon final; (4) depo, chanm sèvis, klozèt risers, chanm elektrik ak chanm ekipman.\n            Jwen antere + 2 kouch konpoze; konpoze lis san mak zouti; tekstil jan yo endike.\n  Nivo 4 – Kote: miray ak plafon ki resevwa penti oswa tapi. Jwen antere + 3 kouch konpoze; lis, san mak.\n  Nivo 5 – Kote: (1) miray ak penti briyan, semi-briyan oswa emay; (2) miray ak plafon ak ekleraj sevè ak lòt zòn ki endike.\n            Jwen antere + 3 kouch konpoze; lis; skim coat \"high build gypsum board surfacer\" (primer-surfacer epè).\n\n3.8 H – NIVO FINISYON DAPRE GA-214 (tablo)\n  Zòn                                                                           | Finisyon\n  Plenums anlè plafon                                                           | Nivo 1, san tekstil\n  Chanm elektrik ak mekanik                                                     | Nivo 2, san tekstil\n  Plak ki reziste imidite kòm baz (sibstra pou finisyon ak adezif)              | Nivo 2\n  Tekstil lejè (orange-peel mwayen)                                             | Nivo 4\n  Finisyon lis; penti saten/eggshell; itilizasyon: sal ak biwo                  | Nivo 4; Nivo 5 kote ki gen ekleraj kritik (sevè) (gade GA-214)\n  Finisyon lis; penti semi-briyan; itilizasyon: twalèt ak koridò                | Nivo 5\n  Tapi kalite lou                                                               | Nivo 3, san tekstil\n  Tapi                                                                          | Nivo 4, san tekstil\n\nPRIMER-SURFACER (2.3.F, paj 6): finisyon enteryè epè ki aplike ak airless, yo itilize l OLIYE skim coat Nivo 5 la;\n  miray ki resevwa l pa bezwen primer drywall anvan kouch finisyon yo (mak yo retire).\nRelasyon ak penti (099123): plak la dwe gen ≤ 12 % imidite epi konpoze a ponse lis anvan ou pentire (gade fichye 06).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"02_092900_Cinta_Compuesto_Primer-Surfacer_y_Accesorios.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – TEYP, KONPOZE, PRIMER-SURFACER, AKSESWA AK PWODWI PLAK","texto":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – TEYP, KONPOZE, PRIMER-SURFACER, AKSESWA AK PWODWI PLAK\n========================\nSous: 092900 GYPSUM BOARD – RFI-092900, Pati 1 ak 2 (paj PDF 3-7). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nMak yo retire espre.\n\nPWODWI PLAK (2.2 Gypsum Board, paj 4-5; 2.4 Sheathing ak 2.5 Cementitious Backer Board, paj 7)\n  - Plak Tip X 5/8\" (ASTM C1396).\n  - Plak ki reziste imidite Tip X 5/8\": absòpsyon ≤ 5 % (ASTM C473); nòt kanni ≥ 8 (ASTM D3273).\n  - Plak fleksib 1/4\" (miray koube).\n  - Sistèm gwo enpak (hi-impact): abrazyon 1000 sik; enpak kò di 115 ft-lb; kò mou 300 ft-lb (ASTM E695);\n    plak 5/8\" + 2 kouch plat kouvèti (veneer plaster).\n  - Plak ki amòti son 5/8\": vis Tip S/S12, sele ak mastik sistèm nan.\n  - Sheathing (deyò): 5/8\" Tip X ak tapi fib vè (ASTM C1177) oswa ranfòse ak fib (ASTM C1278).\n  - Plak siman 1/2\" [5/8\"]: vis No. 6 ak 500 h chanm sèl (B117); teyp mesh 2\" anndan / 4\" deyò;\n    mòtye ANSI A118.1/A118.4; baryè polietilèn 4 mil oswa fet 15#.\nAKSESWA (2.3 Accessories, paj 6-7; gen ladan sa ki swiv jiska LÒT)\n  - Kwen metal (corner bead) ak moulin bò (edge trim): ASTM C1047, asye galvanize.\n  - Jwen kontwòl: an zenk, ak ouvèti pwoteje ki ka retire.\n  - Kouvèti mullion (mullion trim caps) ak STC ≥ 60 (ajoute nan Addendum 2).\nVIS (2.3)\n  - ASTM C1002, otofilte, pou framing mwens pase 0.033\".\n  - ASTM C954 pou framing soti 0.033\" rive 0.112\".\n  - Pou bwa: tip W, penetrasyon minimòm 3/4\".\nTEYP AK KONPOZE (2.3)\n  - Teyp papye 2\", ranfòse (heavy-duty), ASTM C475.\n  - Konpoze pou jwen: ASTM C475 (dapre manifakti; pou baz, ranpli ak finisyon).\nPRIMER-SURFACER (2.3)\n  - Epè (high-build), aplike ak airless; yo itilize l olye skim coat Nivo 5. Miray ki resevwa l pa bezwen primer drywall.\nLÒT (2.3)\n  - Sele akoustik dapre 079200. Kousinen entimesan (putty pads) 7.25\" ak 9\" pou bwat elektrik.\nDOKIMAN POU SOUMÈT AK KALITE (1.3-1.5)\n  - De echantiyon 2' x 2' tekstil espre a. Enstalatè ak 5 pwojè menm jan nan 3 dènye ane yo.\nKONDISYON ANVIWÒNMAN (1.6, p.4)\n  - Minimòm 40 °F pandan y ap poze plak la.\n  - Minimòm 50 °F pou adezif, tretman jwen, tekstil ak dekorasyon, depi 48 h anvan epi san rete jiskaske yo seche. Bay vantilasyon.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"03_092900_Textura.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – TEKSTIL","texto":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – TEKSTIL\n========================\nSous: 092900 GYPSUM BOARD – RFI-092900 (paj PDF 3 [echantiyon], 4 [kondisyon], 10-11 [3.8]). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n\nSa espesifikasyon an di sou tekstil (tout sa ki genyen nan fichye yo):\n  - 3.8: \"Spray apply texture on all gypsum board surfaces, unless noted otherwise.\"\n    -> Tekstil espre sou TOUT sifas plak jips, sof si yo endike lòt bagay.\n  - Nivo 3: zòn ak tekstil lou anvan penti final la; \"Surface to be coated texture as indicated\" (tekstil jan yo endike).\n  - Tablo H: tekstil lejè (orange-peel mwayen) = Nivo 4 ak tekstil. San tekstil: plenums (N1), chanm elektrik/mekanik (N2),\n    penti lis nan sal/biwo (N4/N5), penti semi-briyan nan twalèt/koridò (N5), tapi (N3/N4).\n  - Echantiyon: de echantiyon 2' x 2' tekstil espre a (Pati 1, dokiman pou soumèt).\n  - Kondisyon: ≥ 50 °F pou tekstil la depi 48 h anvan jiskaske li seche, ak vantilasyon.\nPA espesifye: pwodwi/manifakti tekstil la, modèl egzak apa \"orange-peel mwayen\" ak plan kote tekstil yo ye (gade FALTANTES.txt).\nNòt: gen yon kontradiksyon posib. 3.8 mande tekstil \"sou tout sifas\" epi tablo H mande sifas lis san tekstil nan twalèt,\nkoridò, sal ak biwo. Nou kopye l jan li ye; klarifye sa ak achitèk la.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"04_092900_Instalacion_Juntas_de_Control_y_Tolerancias.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – ENSTALASYON PLAK, JWEN KONTWÒL AK TOLERANS (sa ki afekte finisyon an)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – ENSTALASYON PLAK, JWEN KONTWÒL AK TOLERANS (sa ki afekte finisyon an)\n========================\nSous: 092900 GYPSUM BOARD – RFI-092900, atik 3.1-3.7 ak 3.9 (paj PDF 7-12). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n\n3.1 EGZAMEN (p.7): verifye framing, blocking, izolasyon ak firestopping anvan ou poze plak.\n3.2 FIRESTOPPING AK SELE (p.8): putty pads nan bwat elektrik miray ki gen rating.\n3.3 ENSTALASYON (p.8)\n  - Plak Tip X nan koridò (RFI-092900 te chanje plak gwo enpak nan koridò Addendum 2 a pou Tip X).\n  - Plak ki reziste imidite nan zòn imid/mouye; trete bò koupe plak MR yo.\n  - Jwen bout dekale; plak 1/4\" anlè planche; tout wotè an yon sèl moso lè sa posib.\n  - Kote plak la monte tout wotè jiska estrikti a: koupe l 3/8\" (nominal) pi kout pou defleksyon epi sele bò anwo a ak yon kòdon kontinyèl (fèmti elastik).\n  - Fikse ak vis.\n  - Kwen metal nan tout kwen deyò; moulin bò (edge trim) kote plak la kontre ak lòt materyèl.\n  - JWEN KONTWÒL nan:\n      · jwen konstriksyon bilding lan;\n      · miray ki depase 30 pye lineyè;\n      · plafon ak soulajman perimèt: pa plis pase 50 ft ak zòn pa plis pase 2500 ft²;\n      · plafon san soulajman perimèt: pa plis pase 30 ft ak zòn pa plis pase 900 ft²;\n      · plafon ak sofit deyò: pa plis pase 30 ft ak 900 ft²;\n      · chanjman direksyon framing;\n      · tranzisyon soti nan framing ki apiye sou planche pou ale nan framing ki pandye.\n3.4 ASANBLAJ AK RATING (p.9): dapre konsepsyon UL/GA-600; sele jwen yo; firestopping dapre 078400.\n3.5 PLAK KI AMÒTI SON (p.9): GA-201/216/600; espas perimèt 1/4\" rive 1/2\" ak moulin ak sele akoustik (ASTM C919);\n    vis a 16\" o.c. omwen; kòdon sele 1/8\" rive 3/8\" sou perimèt panno a ak nan bwat yo; mastik otou bwat yo.\n3.6 SHEATHING (p.9): GA-253; vis a 3/8\" de bò yo; pa fonse tèt yo.\n3.7 PLAK SIMAN (p.10): ANSI A108.11; vis a 8\" o.c. maksimòm, 3/8\" de bout yo ak 5/8\" de bò yo; tèt yo ras; blocking anplis kote sa nesesè.\n3.9 TOLERANS (p.12)\n  - Plat: varyasyon maksimòm 1/4\" sou 10 ft nan nenpòt direksyon.\n  - Sibstra pou kawo seramik: \"Refer to Section 093013\" (pa t jwenn okenn valè nimerik nan 093013; gade FALTANTES.txt).\n  - Koubi konpoze a: maksimòm 1/32\" (3.8.E).\nKondisyon anviwònman (1.6, p.4): ≥ 40 °F pou poze plak; ≥ 50 °F pou tretman jwen, tekstil ak dekorasyon, depi 48 h anvan jiskaske li seche.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"05_092900_Historial_de_Versiones.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – ISTORIK VÈSYON (pou itilize sa ki an vigè a)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 29 00 – ISTORIK VÈSYON (pou itilize sa ki an vigè a)\n========================\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n        [PDF sous nan biwo a]\n        [PDF sous nan biwo a]  <- AN VIGÈ\n\n1. Manual V1, paj PDF 755-765: vèsyon orijinal. Li deja gen tablo nivo GA-214 (3.8.H), tekstil espre \"sou tout sifas\n   sof si yo endike\" ak primer-surfacer olye skim coat Nivo 5.\n2. Addendum 2, paj PDF 145-155: ajoute kouvèti mullion (mullion trim caps) ak \"Install hi-impact gypsum board at corridors\"\n   (plak gwo enpak nan koridò).\n3. RFI-092900 (dokiman 13 paj ki soti kòm repons RFI sa a): chanje pou \"Install type X gypsum board at corridors\" (plak Tip X nan koridò)\n   epi ajoute pwen 3.8.G ak kote yo ak kantite kouch pou chak nivo (1 rive 5).\nPou finisyon, se vèsyon RFI-092900 la pou itilize.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"06_099123_Preparacion_de_Drywall_para_Pintura.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 91 23 – EGZIJANS PENTI ENTERYÈ SOU PLAK JIPS KI FINI","texto":"SEKSYON 09 91 23 – EGZIJANS PENTI ENTERYÈ SOU PLAK JIPS KI FINI\n========================\nSous: Addendum 2, paj PDF 165-167 (099123, atik 3.01-3.02) ak p.171 (tablo G). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la) (tout seksyon an nan PDF sous la, nan biwo a)\n\n- Egzamen (3.01): imidite maksimòm plak jips la 12 % (mèt elektwonik). Verifye konpoze a ponse lis;\n  pa kòmanse jiskaske yo korije kondisyon ki pa akseptab yo.\n- Preparasyon (3.02): dapre MPI. Retire pousyè ak lakre; ranpli (spackle) ras fant ak ti defo yo epi ponse.\n  Si defo parèt apre primer la, ranpli ankò anvan pwochen kouch la.\n- Sistèm sou plak (3.06.G): miray ak primer latèks + 2 kouch emay latèks akrilik; plafon ak primer + 2 kouch (mat);\n  zòn mouye epoksi akrilik pre-katalize; pakin ak latèks akrilik deyò; anba tapi, yon primer ki pèmèt retire l.\n- Si yo itilize primer-surfacer 092900 la, miray ki resevwa l pa bezwen primer drywall (092900 2.3.F).\n- Ekla semi-briyan/emay mande Nivo 5 dapre 092900 (3.8.G ak H). Pa defo 099123 mande eggshell sou miray ak semi-gloss sou trim.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"07_092116.23_Shaft_Wall_Acabado.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 21 16.23 – SHAFT WALL (MIRAY DIK) AN PLAK JIPS: PATI KI TOUCHE FINISYON AN","texto":"SEKSYON 09 21 16.23 – SHAFT WALL (MIRAY DIK) AN PLAK JIPS: PATI KI TOUCHE FINISYON AN\n========================\nSous: Manual V1, paj PDF 739-744 (sèl vèsyon yo jwenn). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nFraming seksyon sa a nan dosye \"Espesifikasyon framing\".\n\n- Kondisyon: dapre ASTM C840; enstale sèlman nan espas ki fèmen e ki gen klimatizasyon; refize panno ki mouye oswa ki gen kanni.\n- Rating dapre ASTM E119; tès akoustik E90/E413.\n- Fas: bò chanm nan, plak jips dapre 092900. Bò shaft la, shaftliner 1\": Tip X ki reziste imidite\n  (kanni ASTM D3273 nòt 10, bizo doub) oswa Tip X ekspozisyon pwolonje (ASTM C1658, jiska 12 mwa).\n- Moulin (trim) dapre 092900. Vis ASTM C1002.\n- Jwen kontwòl dapre ASTM C840. Izole perimèt la epi sele ak sele akoustik (079219).\n- Panno fini panche (cant panels) nan pati ki depase plis pase 4\": plak 1/2\" oswa 5/8\", ang ≥ 75°, vis a 24\" o.c., framing a 24\" o.c.\n- Tolerans: 1/8\" (gade tèks nan PDF).\n- Tretman jwen ak nivo finisyon bò chanm nan swiv 092900 3.8 (fichye 01).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"08_Notas_de_Acabado_en_Planos.txt":{"titulo":"NÒT FINISYON PLAK JIPS NAN PLAN YO","texto":"NÒT FINISYON PLAK JIPS NAN PLAN YO\n========================\nKopi (1 paj chak) nan biwo a: [PDF nan biwo a], [PDF nan biwo a],\n[PDF nan biwo a]\nTèks an angle jan li parèt, ak tradiksyon.\n\nA8.1 Partition Types and Schedules (revizyon RFI-A8.1)\n  - Nòt 3: \"ALL GYP. BD. TO BE 5/8\" THICK TYPE 'X' UNO; PAINT ALL EXPOSED FACES.\" -> plak 5/8\" Tip X sof si yo endike; pentire tout fas ki ekspoze.\n  - Kondisyon inik nan kle tip yo: 2 = SAB (izolasyon akoustik); 3 = kanal rezilyan + SAB; 4 = tile backer (plak baz pou kawo);\n    8 = tile backer + baryè lè/vapè. Yo endike kote plak siman oswa plak baz pou kawo ale (finisyon dapre 092900 3.7 ak 093013).\nA3.21 Ceiling Details (IFC)\n  - Nòt 10: miray jiska anba dal la, eksepte miray ki gen lonbraj, kote plak la depase 4\" anlè plafon an\n    (Nivo 1 oswa 2 anlè plafon dapre 092900).\n  - Tip plafon: GWB-1 (plak sou studs ki pandye nan asanblaj etaj ki gen rating), GWB-2 (kole ak estrikti a, gade A6.0),\n    GWB-3 (2 h ak rating, sou studs metal).\n  - Detay 1C: jwen ekspansyon 1\" ak kouvèti kontinyèl.\n  - Detay 1D: casing bead perimèt separe 1/4\" ak miray la, ak backer rod ak sele.\n  - Detay 2A: jwen kontwòl nan plafon ak espas 1/4\".\n  - Detay 2C/2D: panno aksè ak konpoze sou perimèt ouvèti a; ouvèti = lajè panno a + 1/4\".\n  - Nòt 11: penti nan zòn komen ak estrikti ki parèt (gade dosye penti).\nA7.10 Stair and Elevator Details (IFC)\n  - \"GWB ON METAL STUDS BETWEEN STRINGERS AND ALONG BEAM/BELOW LANDING - SEE SECTIONS\"\n  - \"CASING BEAD AND 1/4\" SEALANT WHERE GWB OCCURS\" -> casing bead ak sele 1/4\" kote ki gen plak.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"08_acabado_niveles_tolerancias.txt":{"titulo":"FINISYON (NIVO 1-5) AK TOLERANS - SEKSYON 092900","texto":"FINISYON (NIVO 1-5) AK TOLERANS - SEKSYON 092900\n\n1. RÈG JENERAL (3.8; V1 p764 / RFI-092900 p10)\n- \"Finish gypsum board surfaces in accordance with ASTM C840, GA-214 and GA-216.\"\n- \"Set mechanical fasteners below the plane of the board.\"\n- \"Tape, fill, and sand all joints, edges and corners to produce smooth surface ready to receive finishes.\"\n- \"Feather coats onto adjoining surfaces so that camber is maximum 1/32-inch.\"\n- \"Spray apply texture on all gypsum board surfaces, unless noted otherwise.\"\n- Teyp (2.3.D): \"ASTM C475/C475M; 2 inch wide heavy duty paper joint tape.\" ; Konpoze (2.3.E): \"ASTM C475/C475M.\"\n- Primer-surfacer (2.3.F): \"used in lieu of skim coat in a Level 5 finish ... applied with an airless sprayer.\"\n\n2. DEFINISYON NIVO YO (sèlman nan RFI-092900 3.8.G, p10-12)\n- Level 1: \"Fire-resistance-rated wall areas above finished ceilings, whether or not accessible in the completed construction.\" / \"Apply one coat joint compound over joints, angles, fastener heads, and accessories.\"\n- Level 2: \"Fire-rated, sound-rated, and smoke-rated assemblies in ceiling plenums and concealed areas.\" / \"Use at concealed areas and construction not indicated to be Levels 3, 4, or 5.\" / one coat.\n- Level 3: \"Walls to receive FRP panels.\" ; \"Areas to receive heavy texture finishes before final painting.\" ; heavy duty wallcoverings ; \"storage, service rooms, riser closets, electrical rooms, and equipment rooms.\" / \"Apply 2 coats joint compound\"\n- Level 4: \"Walls and ceilings to receive paint finish or wall coverings.\" / \"Apply 3 coats joint compound over joints, angles, fastener heads, and accessories.\" / \"Smooth and free of tool marks and ridges.\"\n- Level 5: \"Walls with glossy, semigloss, and enamel finishes.\" ; \"Walls and ceilings to receive areas of severe lighting and other areas specifically indicated.\" / 3 coats / \"Skim Coat: High build gypsum board surfacer.\"\n\n3. TABLO PA ZÒN (GA-214) (V1 p764-765 3.8.G / RFI-092900 p12 3.8.H)\n- \"Plenum areas above ceilings.\" -> \"Level 1 finish, no texture.\"\n- \"Electrical and mechanical rooms.\" -> \"Level 2 finish, no texture.\"\n- \"Moisture resistant gypsum backing board (substrate for adhesive applied finish material).\" -> \"Level 2 finish.\"\n- \"Light texture (medium orange-peel).\" -> \"Level 4 finish.\"\n- \"Smooth finish; satin/eggshell paint finish; use: classrooms and offices.\" -> \"Level 4 finish. Level 5 finish where critical (severe) lighting condition occurs (refer to GA-214 ...)\"\n- \"Smooth finish; semi-gloss paint finish; use: restrooms and corridors.\" -> \"Level 5 finish.\"\n- \"Heavy-grade wall covering.\" -> \"Level 3 finish, no texture.\"\n- \"Wall covering.\" -> \"Level 4 finish, no texture.\"\n\n4. TOLERANS\n- 092900 3.9.A (V1 p765 / RFI-092900 p12): \"Maximum variation from true flatness: 1/4 inch in 10 feet in any direction.\"\n- 092900 3.9.B: sibstra pou seramik: \"Refer to Section 093013.\"\n- 092216 3.04.H (V1 p753) ak 092116.23 3.03.J (V1 p743): framing \"vary not more than 1/8 inch from the plane formed by faces of adjacent framing.\"\n- 092216 3.05.F (V1 p754): suspension \"level to within 1/8 inch in 12 feet\".\n- 092900 3.3.C: \"Install 1/4 inch (nominal) above rough floor or curb.\"\n\n5. ECHANTIYON\n- 092900 1.3.C (V1 p757 / RFI-092900 p3): \"Submit two 2 foot by 2 foot samples of spray-applied texture finish.\"\n\n6. NÒT / PA JWENN\n- Konfli pou revize (san entèpretasyon): RFI-092900 Level 2 gen ladan \"Fire-rated ... assemblies in ceiling plenums\" pandan tablo a bay \"Plenum areas above ceilings\" = Level 1.\n- Plan finisyon ki endike \"severe lighting\" oswa zòn Level 5 espesifik: PA JWENN.\n"},"01_099123_Pintura_Interior.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 91 23 – PENTI ENTERYÈ (INTERIOR PAINTING)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 91 23 – PENTI ENTERYÈ (INTERIOR PAINTING)\n========================\nVèsyon an vigè: Addendum 2, paj PDF 162-172 (ranplase Manual V1, paj 840-849).\nDiferans yo jwenn V1 -> Addendum 2: se sèlman pwen 3.06.J \"Egzijans espesyal pou koridò\" ki te ajoute (rès tèks la menm).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nNòt: manifaktirè ak non komèsyal pwodwi ki nan sous la retire isit la espre; gade yo nan PDF sous la.\n\n1. KOUVÈTI TRAVAY (1.02, p.162)\n   Preparasyon sifas ak aplikasyon sistèm penti sou sibstra enteryè:\n   beton, blòk beton (CMU), asye ak fè, metal galvanize, bwa ak plak jips (gypsum board).\n   Ki gen rapò (p.163): primer atelye pou asye estriktirèl (Div. 05), 055000 Metal Fabrications,\n   055116 eskalye an plak, 055213 balistrad tib, 099600 High-Performance Coatings.\n   Egzijans dirab: CDPH v1.2-2017 (emisyon), limit VOC CARB 2007 SCM / SCAQMD Règ 1113.\n\n2. DOKIMAN POU SOUMÈT (1.03-1.04, p.163)\n   - Product data chak pwodwi, ak kantite VOC.\n   - Echantiyon pou premye seleksyon (chak kalite finisyon final) ak echantiyon verifikasyon\n     pou chak sistèm, koulè ak ekla: sou sipò rijid 8\" x 8\", aplike pa etap pou montre chak kouch, ak etikèt.\n   - Lis pwodwi ak referans kwaze ak sistèm ak kote yo, ak deziyasyon koulè.\n   - Done antretyen (netwayaj, retouch, reparasyon) ak Manyèl Antretyen Revètman\n     (rezime pa zòn ak tablo finisyon, ki kote chak pwodwi/koulè/finisyon te itilize, fich teknik,\n     MSDS, netwayaj, pwosedi retouch ak echantiyon koulè).\n   - Materyèl anplis: penti 5 %, men pa mwens pase 1 galon chak materyèl ak koulè ki aplike.\n\n3. KALITE AK MOCK-UPS (1.05, p.164)\n   - Aplikatè ak omwen 5 an eksperyans.\n   - Mockups chak sistèm ak chak koulè/finisyon: sifas vètikal ak orizontal omwen 100 ft².\n     Apwobasyon final koulè yo baze sou mockups yo.\n\n4. ESTOKAJ AK KONDISYON CHANTYE (1.06-1.07, p.164)\n   - Estoke a pa mwens pase 45 °F nan veso fèmen ki gen vantilasyon.\n   - Aplike sèlman lè tanperati sifas ak anviwònman ant 50 °F ak 95 °F.\n   - Pa aplike lè imidite relatif > 85 %, a mwens pase 5 °F anlè pwen lawouze, ni sou sifas mouye.\n\n5. PWODWI – JENERAL (2.01-2.04, p.164-165)\n   - Pwodwi baz konsepsyon dapre tablo a, oswa ekivalan youn nan 3 manifaktirè ki nan lis la.\n   - Tout pwodwi nan yon menm sistèm dwe soti nan menm manifaktirè, \"san eksepsyon\".\n   - Primers: konpatib ak finisyon an; lè manifaktirè a ofri opsyon, itilize sa ki klase \"best\".\n   - Koulè ak ekla: dapre plan yo; sa ki pa endike, se achitèk la ki chwazi.\n     Pa defo: FINISYON EGGSHELL SOU MIRAY ak SEMI-GLOSS SOU TRIM (moulin/kad).\n   - Pa pentire: eleman ki gen finisyon faktori, etikèt rating, asye pur/aliminyòm anodize/bwonz,\n     wòch natirèl, planche (sof si yo endike), kawo, vit, materyèl akoustik (sof si yo endike),\n     tiyo/kondui/conduit ki kache.\n\n6. EGZAMEN (3.01, p.165)\n   Imidite maksimòm (mèt elektwonik): beton 12 %; mason/CMU 12 %; bwa 15 %; plak jips 12 %.\n   Plak jips: verifye konpoze a (finishing compound) ponse lis.\n\n7. PREPARASYON (3.02, p.166-167)\n   - Swiv manifaktirè a ak \"MPI Architectural Painting Specification Manual\".\n   - Asye: retire wouy, kal ak primer atelye; netwayaj minimòm SSPC-SP 2.\n   - Asye ak primer atelye: netwaye soudi chantye, koneksyon ak zòn ki grate; retouche ak menm\n     materyèl primer atelye a dapre SSPC-PA 1.\n   - Galvanize: degrese mekanikman jiskaske sifas la pwòp e yon ti jan grave.\n   - Bwa: sele ne yo, ponse, mete primer sou tout fas, ranpli ak mastik epi ponse.\n   - Plak jips: retire pousyè/lakre; ranpli (spackle) fant ak ti defo yo ras epi ponse; si apre\n     primer la defo parèt, ranpli ankò anvan pwochen kouch la.\n\n8. APLIKASYON (3.03, p.167)\n   - Pentire dèyè mèb ki ka deplase menm jan ak sa ki ekspoze; dèyè ekipman fiks sèlman primer.\n   - Pentire de fas panno aksè ak kouvèti ki louvri.\n   - Tente chak kouch anba nan yon ton pi klè pou distenge kouch yo; aplike plis kouch si li transparan.\n   - Pentire kote yo ekspoze (chanm ekipman): ekipman ak panno, tiyo metal ak plastik san izolasyon,\n     sipò, conduit metal ak plastik, tank san finisyon final, izolasyon ak jakèt ki ka pentire.\n     Nan espas ki okipe: menm bagay (eksepte tank) plis sa achitèk la endike.\n   - Pentire anndan kondui san doubli ki parèt dèyè griy yo.\n\n9. KONTWÒL KALITE (3.04, p.168): pwopriyetè a ka peye tès epesè fim sèk (DFT);\n   si li pa konfòm, kontraktè a peye tès la epi aplike plis kouch.\n\n10. TABLO PENTI ENTERYÈ (3.06, p.168-172) – tout ak \"Two Top Coats\" (2 kouch finisyon) sou primer\n   A. Beton (san sikilasyon):\n      - Jeneral: primer latèks pou beton + 2 kouch emay latèks akrilik.\n      - Twalèt piblik, fitness/lockers, tanning, chanm netwayaj, lave bèt, lesiv, fatra ak lòt menm jan:\n        primer pou beton + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik yon sèl konpozan pre-katalize (baz dlo).\n      - Anndan pakin: primer pou beton + 2 kouch latèks akrilik deyò.\n   B. CMU:\n      - Jeneral: block filler latèks + 2 kouch emay latèks akrilik.\n      - Zòn mouye (menm lis anlè a): block filler + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik pre-katalize.\n      - Anndan pakin: block filler latèks + 2 kouch latèks akrilik deyò.\n   C. Asye estriktirèl ekspoze: sistèm poliyiretàn wo pèfòmans Seksyon 099600.\n   D. Asye – fabrikasyon metal, balistrad, pòt ak kad tòl (hollow metal):\n      retouch ak primer ki anpeche wouy (si li gen primer atelye) oswa primer antikowozyon (si li pa genyen)\n      + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik pre-katalize.\n      Deck metal/kouvèti metal nan twati (pre-primed): primer atelye manifaktirè a + 2 kouch \"dry fall\" akrilik baz dlo.\n   E. Galvanize – kondui: primer pou galvanize + 2 kouch emay akrilik endistriyèl baz dlo.\n      Deck galvanize nan twati: 2 kouch dry fall akrilik baz dlo.\n   F. Bwa – trim ak pòt: primer pou bwa + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik pre-katalize.\n   G. Plak jips:\n      - Miray: primer latèks + 2 kouch emay latèks akrilik.\n      - Plafon: primer latèks + 2 kouch latèks akrilik (pwodwi ki nan lis yo se finisyon mat/flat).\n      - Zòn mouye (twalèt piblik, fitness/lockers, tanning, netwayaj, lave bèt, lesiv, fatra,\n        fas enteryè miray deyò ki make ak epoksi ak lòt menm jan): primer + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik pre-katalize.\n      - Anndan pakin: primer + 2 kouch latèks akrilik deyò.\n      - Anba tapi (wall covering): primer akrilik latèks ki pèmèt retire tapi a san domaje papye plak la.\n   H. Egzijans espesyal pakin: liy separasyon ak mak aksesib; nimewo nan chak plas;\n      PENTI BLAN BRIYAN (white gloss) sou tout miray ak plafon drywall; CMU pwòp e san penti;\n      nimewo nivo an estensil omwen 4 ft wotè nan chak eskalye ak lobi asansè;\n      pake siyalizasyon (Level 1, Level 2..., SLOW DOWN, Building entry, Stairwell Entry, Future Resident parking).\n   I. Egzijans espesyal inite (apatman): 1 miray aksan nan salon an ak 1 pa chanm;\n      EGGSHELL sou miray, SEMI-GLOSS sou trim, FLAT (mat) sou plafon.\n   J. Egzijans espesyal koridò (ajoute nan Addendum 2): tout sistèm omwen 2 kouch\n      (plis si yo endike); miray eggshell; trim semi-gloss.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"02_099113_Pintura_Exterior.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 91 13 – PENTI DEYÒ (EXTERIOR PAINTING)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 91 13 – PENTI DEYÒ (EXTERIOR PAINTING)\n========================\nSous: Manual V1, paj PDF 833-839 (sèl vèsyon yo jwenn; li pa parèt nan Addendum 2, Addendum 3 ni nan RFI yo revize yo).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nManifaktirè ak non komèsyal retire espre (gade PDF sous la).\n\n1. DOKIMAN POU SOUMÈT (1.03-1.04, p.834)\n   - Product data ak kantite VOC; echantiyon seleksyon ak verifikasyon 8\" x 8\" sou sipò rijid,\n     aplike pa etap pou montre chak kouch epi ak etikèt; lis pwodwi ak kote ak koulè.\n   - Manyèl antretyen revètman (menm jan ak 099123).\n   - Materyèl anplis: 5 % men pa mwens pase 1 galon chak materyèl ak koulè.\n2. KALITE (1.05): aplikatè ak omwen 5 an; mockups chak sistèm/koulè omwen 100 ft².\n3. KOWÒDINASYON (1.06, p.835): kowòdone finisyon ak primer atelye; kouch entèmedyè si yo nesesè pou konpatibilite.\n4. ESTOKAJ: minimòm 45 °F.\n5. KONDISYON CHANTYE (1.08): aplike ant 50 °F ak 95 °F (sifas ak anviwònman); pa aplike lè gen lanèj, lapli,\n   bwouya oswa labrim, HR > 85 %, a mwens pase 5 °F pwen lawouze, ni sou sifas mouye.\n6. PWODWI (2.01-2.03, p.835-836)\n   - Baz konsepsyon dapre tablo a oswa ekivalan youn nan 3 manifaktirè ki nan lis la.\n   - Kouvèti: pentire tout sifas deyò ki vizib, sof finisyon faktori oswa sa ki endike san finisyon.\n     Pa pentire: finisyon faktori, etikèt, twati ak flashing ki pa metal, inoks/anodize/bwonz, wòch, planche,\n     kawo, vit, materyèl akoustik, tiyo/kondui ki kache.\n   - Yon sèl manifaktirè pou chak sistèm (san eksepsyon) epi, si posib, nan tout pwojè a.\n   - Primer \"best\" manifaktirè a. Koulè ak ekla dapre plan yo oswa chwa achitèk la.\n7. EGZAMEN (3.01, p.836): imidite maksimòm beton 12 %, mason/CMU 12 %, bwa 15 %; randisaj siman ki fin sèk nèt.\n8. PREPARASYON (3.02, p.836-837): MPI; asye SSPC-SP 2; retouch primer atelye dapre SSPC-PA 1; galvanize\n   degresaj mekanik; fibwosiman pwòp e nan limit imidite/alkalinite ki pèmèt; bwa: sele ne pou deyò, ponse, mete primer sou tout fas, ranpli.\n9. APLIKASYON (3.03, p.837-838)\n   - Pentire DE FAS AK BÒ PÒT DEYÒ yo ak tout sifas ekspoze kad pòt deyò yo.\n   - Pentire tout sifas ekspoze kad ak batan fenèt yo.\n   - Kouch anba yo tente nan yon ton pi klè; plis kouch si li transparan.\n   - Pentire kote yo vizib: ekipman ak panno, tiyo metal ak plastik san izolasyon, sipò, conduit, tank san finisyon final.\n10. KONTWÒL KALITE (3.04, p.838): tès epesè fim sèk si pwopriyetè a vle.\n11. TABLO PENTI DEYÒ (3.06, p.838-839)\n   A. Beton – divès sifas san sikilasyon: sistèm akrilik epè:\n      primer ki reziste alkali baz dlo + 2 kouch akrilik deyò epè, DFT pa mwens pase 10 mils.\n      Beton – sifas vètikal (miray ak kolòn): revètman elastomerik enpèmeyab Seksyon 099653.\n   B. CMU yon sèl ranje (single wythe): revètman elastomerik Seksyon 099653.\n   C. Asye estriktirèl ekspoze: sistèm poliyiretàn wo pèfòmans Seksyon 099600.\n   D. Asye ak fè: sistèm akrilik endistriyèl lejè: retouch ak primer ki anpeche wouy (si li gen primer atelye)\n      oswa primer antikowozyon deyò (si li pa genyen) + 2 kouch akrilik endistriyèl lejè deyò.\n   E. Galvanize: primer pou galvanize deyò + 2 kouch akrilik endistriyèl lejè deyò.\n   F. Bwa (trim): primer latèks deyò pou bwa + 2 kouch latèks akrilik deyò.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"03_099600_Recubrimientos_Alto_Desempeno.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 96 00 – REVÈTMAN WO PÈFÒMANS (HIGH-PERFORMANCE COATINGS)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 96 00 – REVÈTMAN WO PÈFÒMANS (HIGH-PERFORMANCE COATINGS)\n========================\nSous: Manual V1, paj PDF 850-857 (sèl vèsyon yo jwenn).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nManifaktirè ak non komèsyal retire espre (gade PDF sous la).\n\n1. KOUVÈTI TRAVAY (1.2, p.850): sibstra DEYÒ: beton, CMU, asye ak metal galvanize.\n   Ki gen rapò: Div. 05 (primer atelye asye estriktirèl ak primer seksyon sa a), 055213 balistrad,\n   099113 ak 099123 (penti jeneral). 099113 ak 099123 voye nan seksyon sa a pou ASYE ESTRIKTIRÈL EKSPOZE.\n2. DOKIMAN POU SOUMÈT (1.3-1.4): product data ak VOC; echantiyon 8\" x 8\" pa etap; lis pwodwi; done ak manyèl antretyen;\n   materyèl anplis 5 % epi pa mwens pase 1 galon pa materyèl ak koulè.\n3. KALITE (1.5, p.852)\n   - Aplikatè ak 5 an.\n   - REPREZANTAN TEKNIK MANIFAKTIRÈ A: patisipe nan reyinyon anvan yo, egzamine sibstra yo, asiste tès yo epi enspekte enstalasyon final la; li bay rapò ekri.\n   - Mockups omwen 100 ft² (miray ak plafon) + echantiyon reparasyon finisyon (preparasyon, difizyon, tekstil ak koulè).\n4. KONDISYON (1.7-1.8): estoke a 45 °F min.; aplike ant 50 °F ak 95 °F; HR ≤ 85 %; ≥ 5 °F anlè pwen lawouze; pa aplike deyò lè gen lanèj, lapli, bwouya oswa labrim.\n5. GARANTI (1.9, p.853): garanti espesyal manifaktirè a kont kowozyon pou 5 AN depi fen sibstansyèl travay la;\n   echèk = kowozyon plis pase 1 % sifas la dapre ASTM D 610.\n6. PWODWI (2.1-2.4, p.853-854)\n   - Baz konsepsyon dapre tablo a oswa ekivalan youn nan 4 manifaktirè ki nan lis la; tout kouch yon sistèm soti nan menm manifaktirè.\n   - Sele jwen konpatib: iretàn yon sèl konpozan ki pa koule, ASTM C 920 Tip S, Grad NS, Klas 25, Itilizasyon NT (±25 % mouvman).\n   - Epoksi pou ranpli ak repare 100 % solid pou enpèfeksyon asye a.\n7. EGZAMEN (3.1): imidite maksimòm beton 12 %, mason 12 %.\n8. PREPARASYON (3.2, p.854-855)\n   - Ranpli ak epoksi reparasyon enpèfeksyon asye ki VIZIB A 10 FT distans.\n   - Ranpli ak sele jwen ak entèfas ki pa byen kouvri ak penti.\n   - Asye: netwayaj minimòm SSPC-SP 10 / NACE No. 2. Primer atelye: retouch dapre SSPC-PA 1.\n   - Sifas ki resevwa primer ki rich an zenk: preparasyon SSPC-SP 11 anvan primer la.\n   - Galvanize: degresaj mekanik, sifas yon ti jan grave.\n9. APLIKASYON (3.3): dapre manifaktirè a ak MPI; kouch anba yo tente; san defo (holidays, koule, elatriye).\n10. KONTWÒL KALITE (3.4): reprezantan teknik la prezan nan tès ak enspeksyon; tès DFT si pwopriyetè a vle.\n11. RETOUCH (3.5.D, p.856): asye ak primer zenk: prepare ak SSPC-SP 11 (zouti mekanik jiska metal toutouni); difize bò yo;\n    pwofile penti ki deja la e ki byen kole epi aplike tie coat ak primer sistèm nan.\n12. TABLO DEYÒ (3.6, p.856-857)\n   A. Beton: revètman elastomerik dapre 099653.\n   B. CMU: revètman elastomerik dapre 099653.\n   C. ASYE: poliyiretàn pigmante sou primer òganik rich an zenk ak epoksi epè (zenk minimòm 80 % nan fim sèk):\n      - Primer: rich an zenk, òganik, 2.5 rive 3.5 mils DFT.\n      - Kouch entèmedyè: epoksi epè, ekla ba, 5.0 rive 8.0 mils DFT.\n      - Finisyon: poliyiretàn de konpozan, pigmante, briyan, 2.0 rive 3.0 mils DFT.\n   D. GALVANIZE: sistèm poliyiretàn pigmante:\n      - Primer: epoksi pou metal, 2.0 rive 4.0 mils DFT.\n      - Finisyon: poliyiretàn de konpozan, pigmante, briyan, 2.0 rive 4.0 mils DFT.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"04_099653_Recubrimientos_Elastomericos.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 09 96 53 – REVÈTMAN ELASTOMERIK (ELASTOMERIC COATINGS)","texto":"SEKSYON 09 96 53 – REVÈTMAN ELASTOMERIK (ELASTOMERIC COATINGS)\n========================\nSous: Manual V1, paj PDF 858-867 (sèl vèsyon yo jwenn).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\nManifaktirè ak non komèsyal retire espre (gade PDF sous la).\n099113 voye isit la miray/kolòn vètikal an beton ak CMU yon sèl ranje deyò.\n\n1. KOUVÈTI TRAVAY (1.2, p.858): sibstra deyò an beton ak blòk beton (CMU).\n2. DOKIMAN POU SOUMÈT (1.3-1.4, p.859): product data ak VOC; echantiyon 8\" x 8\" sou menm kalite sibstra, pa etap\n   (gen ladan primer ak block filler); lis pwodwi; manyèl antretyen; materyèl anplis 5 % epi pa mwens pase 1 galon\n   pa materyèl, koulè ak tekstil (nan menm lo a).\n3. KALITE (1.5, p.860): aplikatè 5 an; mockups omwen 100 ft² + echantiyon reparasyon finisyon.\n4. KONDISYON (1.6-1.7): estoke a 45 °F min.; aplike ant 50 °F ak 90 °F (sof si manifaktirè a pèmèt lòt bagay);\n   pa aplike lè gen lanèj, lapli, bwouya, HR > 85 %, a mwens pase 5 °F pwen lawouze ni sou sifas mouye.\n5. GARANTI (1.8, p.861): 10 AN depi fen sibstansyèl travay la kont dlo ki pase atravè revètman an ak degradasyon ki depase move tan nòmal.\n6. MATERYÈL (2.3, p.861-862): transmisyon vapè minimòm 10 perms (ASTM D1653); pwodwi menm manifaktirè pou chak sistèm;\n   ranplisè fant, primer ki reziste alkali ak block filler latèks wo pèfòmans manifaktirè a rekòmande.\n7. EGZAMEN (3.1, p.862): imidite sibstra ≤ 12 %; kòmanse pa anvan 28 jou (oswa sa manifaktirè a di, sa ki pi sevè a)\n   apre yo fin bati sibstra a epi li sèk vizyèlman sou de bò yo; alkalinite nan limit manifaktirè a.\n8. PREPARASYON (3.2): MPI; netwayaj; repare fant yo anvan ou kouvri.\n9. APLIKASYON (3.3, p.863): chak kouch apa; primer ak block filler nan to kouvèti konplè (pò yo ranpli);\n   kantite kouch ak DFT total dapre manifaktirè a ak sa ki nesesè pou garanti a; kouch anba yo tente;\n   ESPRE sèlman si otorite a pèmèt li, epi PA fè \"double back\" pou fè de kouch nan yon sèl pase.\n10. KONTWÒL KALITE (3.4): pwopriyetè a ka pran echantiyon materyèl epi verifye epesè ki enstale.\n11. TABLO (3.6, p.864-867)\n   Y. BETON:\n      1. Sistèm elastomerik silikòn: enpèmeyab, ki respire, tekstil lis, DFT minimòm total 10 mils.\n         Primer dapre manifaktirè + kouch entèmedyè silikòn 100 % baz dlo (min. 5 mils DFT) + finisyon silikòn (min. 5 mils DFT).\n      2. Sistèm elastomerik akrilik: tekstil lis; primer dapre manifaktirè + entèmedyè akrilik elastomerik 4.0-8.0 mils DFT\n         + finisyon akrilik elastomerik 4.0-8.0 mils DFT (DFT ak kantite kouch sa ki nesesè pou garanti a).\n      2 (sic). Sistèm akrilik epè (hi-build): primer dapre manifaktirè + finisyon 12.0-15.0 mils DFT,\n         ak 10 oswa mwens ti twou (pinholes) pa ft².\n   Z. CMU: menm twa sistèm yo, ak BLOCK FILLER olye primer nan sistèm silikòn ak akrilik elastomerik\n      (hi-build sou CMU endike \"Prime Coat\" dapre manifaktirè).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"05_Imprimado_de_taller_Div05_y_Puertas_081113.txt":{"titulo":"PRIMER ATELYE (SHOP PRIMING) AK RETOUCH – ASYE DIV. 05 AK PÒT/KAD 08 11 13","texto":"PRIMER ATELYE (SHOP PRIMING) AK RETOUCH – ASYE DIV. 05 AK PÒT/KAD 08 11 13\n========================\nSeksyon sa yo se pa seksyon penti, men yo fikse primer ki soti nan atelye a epi yo voye nan 099113/099123/099600\npou finisyon ak retouch. Nou itilize vèsyon ki an vigè yo (Addendum 3 kote li egziste; sinon, Manual V1).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n  (li gen Addendum 3 paj 152,153,155,156,160,161,162,165,168,187,191,192,195,282,284 ak Manual V1 paj 311,315,321,323,329, nan lòd sa a)\n\n05 12 00 ASYE ESTRIKTIRÈL (Addendum 3, paj 148-156)\n  - Kowòdone primer atelye ak finisyon yo (p.148). Primer: konfòm ak 099113, 099123 ak 099600 (2.4, p.152).\n  - Penti reparasyon galvanize: MPI#18, MPI#19 oswa SSPC-Paint 20 dapre ASTM A 780 (p.152).\n  - 2.8 Shop priming (p.153): mete primer sou tout bagay eksepte sifas ki antere nan beton (pwolonje primer la 2\" sou moso ki antere an pati),\n    sifas pou soude sou chantye, koneksyon boulon slip-critical ak sifas ki resevwa fireproofing espre.\n    Preparasyon SSPC-SP 2 oswa SSPC-SP 3. Primer ak DFT minimòm 1.5 mils; primer yon kouch ki pa asfaltik dapre SSPC-PS Guide 7.00, ≥1.5 mils.\n  - Retouch apre montaj ak menm materyèl atelye a dapre SSPC-PA 1 (p.155); netwayaj ak retouch primer: dapre 099600 (p.156).\n\n05 21 00 JOISTS ASYE (Addendum 3, paj 157-162)\n  - Primer SSPC-Paint 15 oswa estanda ekivalan manifaktirè a (p.160). Reparasyon galvanize MPI#18/19 oswa SSPC-Paint 20 (p.161).\n  - Netwayaj SSPC-SP 2 oswa SP 3; yon kouch primer atelye, fim kontinyèl pa mwens pase 1 mil (p.161).\n  - Retouch: dapre 099113 ak 099123 (p.162).\n\n05 31 00 DECK METAL / STEEL DECK (Addendum 3, paj 163-168)\n  - Deck konpozit: primer kwit ki anpeche wouy gri oswa blan estanda manifaktirè a (p.165), oswa galvanize G60.\n  - Reparasyon galvanize dapre ASTM A 780; reparasyon primer ak primer menm koulè; bwose ak retouche fas anba a dapre 099113/099123 (p.166-168).\n  - (099123 espesifye pou deck nan twati enteryè 2 kouch \"dry fall\" akrilik.)\n\n05 50 00 FABRIKASYON METAL (Addendum 3, paj 182-199)\n  - Sètifika konpatibilite penti manifaktirè finisyon yo sou primer atelye yo (p.184).\n  - Primers (p.187): konfòm ak 099113/099123/099600; primer baz dlo antikowozyon MPI#107 (ki ka distenge ak sa ki an zenk lan);\n    primer epoksi rich an zenk MPI#20; primer pou galvanize pou deyò; penti reparasyon SSPC-Paint 20; penti bitimen ASTM D 1187.\n  - Mete primer atelye sou fè/asye ki pa galvanize (sof sa ki antere nan beton, ak fireproofing oswa mason) ak primer baz dlo\n    oswa inivèsèl 099113 (p.191).\n  - Kouch zenk obligatwa deyò: moso pou pentire sou chantye = primer rich an zenk; moso san penti = galvanize (p.192).\n  - Preparasyon: deyò, moso ak primer zenk oswa ak primer 099600: SSPC-SP 6/NACE No. 3 (sablaj komèsyal); lòt yo: SSPC-SP 3.\n    Aplike dapre SSPC-PA 1 ak \"stripe coat\" nan kwen, fant, boulon, soudi ak arèt (p.192).\n  - Retouch apre montaj ak menm materyèl atelye a, SSPC-PA 1 (p.195).\n\n05 51 16 ESKALYE AN PLAK (Manual V1, paj 306-317; yo pa jwenn li nan addenda)\n  - Primers dapre 099113 ak 099123; primer inivèsèl alkid modifye MPI#79; primer zenk SSPC-Paint 20 Tip I-A Nivo 1 (p.311).\n  - Preparasyon SSPC-SP 6/NACE No. 3 (eskalye enteryè tou); primer atelye dapre SSPC-PA 1 ak stripe coat (p.315).\n  - Fèy A7.11: pentire balistrad, limon (stringers), gad ak fas anba ekspoze ranp ak palye yo (gade fichye 07).\n\n05 52 13 BALISTRAD TIB (Manual V1, paj 318-325)\n  - Primers dapre 099113/099123/099600; baz dlo MPI#107; epoksi zenk MPI#20 (p.321).\n  - Balistrad: primer zenk atelye pou resevwa finisyon chantye; preparasyon SSPC-SP 6 deyò, ak primer zenk oswa ak primer 099600; SSPC-SP 3 nan lòt yo (p.323).\n\n05 70 00 METAL DEKORATIF (Manual V1, paj 326-332)\n  - Penti reparasyon SSPC-Paint 20; primer epoksi zenk MPI#20; revètman wo pèfòmans: sistèm poliyiretàn 099600 (p.329).\n\n08 11 13 PÒT AK KAD TÒL (HOLLOW METAL) (Addendum 3, paj 272-284)\n  - Penti chantye dapre 099113/099123 (p.272). Fas ekspoze: primer atelye ki anpeche wouy, san plon ni kwomat,\n    ki konfòm ak ANSI/SDI A250.10 (p.282).\n  - Retouch tousuit apre montaj: ponse zòn ki wouye/domaje epi aplike primer anpechman konpatib, primer zenk\n    (deyò ak galvanize) oswa penti finisyon (p.284).\n  - Finisyon chantye dapre 099123: primer + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik pre-katalize (gade fichye 01).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"06_017700_Material_Extra_y_Manual_de_Mantenimiento_Pintura.txt":{"titulo":"SEKSYON 01 77 00 – FEMEN (CLOSEOUT): MATERYÈL ANPLIS AK MANYÈL ANTRETYEN PENTI","texto":"SEKSYON 01 77 00 – FEMEN (CLOSEOUT): MATERYÈL ANPLIS AK MANYÈL ANTRETYEN PENTI\n========================\nSous: Addendum 3, paj PDF 14-15 (Seksyon 017700, atik 1.5 B, pwen 11 ak 12).\nPDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n\n- Pwen 11 – 099113 Penti deyò: penti 5 %, men pa mwens pase 1 galon chak materyèl ak koulè yo aplike;\n  ak Manyèl Antretyen Revètman yo.\n- Pwen 12 – 099123 Penti anndan: menm egzijans (5 %, minimòm 1 galon pa materyèl ak koulè) ak Manyèl Antretyen an.\n- Kontni Manyèl Antretyen Revètman yo (tankou nan 099113/099123 1.04): rezime pa zòn ak tablo finisyon an;\n  detay pa zòn (pwodwi, koulè ak finisyon yo itilize); product data; fèy sekirite (MSDS/SDS); enstriksyon swen ak netwayaj;\n  pwosedi retouch; echantiyon koulè chak koulè ak finisyon.\n- Seksyon an mansyone \"attic stock\" dapre yon \"Appendix S\"; apendis sa a PA nan fichye ki disponib yo (gade FALTANTES.txt).\n- Seksyon 099600 ak 099653 mande pou kont pa yo materyèl anplis: 5 % epi pa mwens pase 1 galon pa materyèl ak koulè (099653: pa tekstil tou).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"07_Pintura_en_Divisiones_MEP_ManualV2.txt":{"titulo":"EGZIJANS PENTI NAN SEKSYON MEP YO (Manual V2)","texto":"EGZIJANS PENTI NAN SEKSYON MEP YO (Manual V2)\n========================\nSous: Manual V2 (Divizyon 21-33). PDF sous: nan biwo a (pa nan app la)\n(7 paj: V2 p.8, 60, 61, 82, 102, 126 ak 236, nan lòd sa a). Non komèsyal retire.\n\n21 00 00 – Pwoteksyon kont dife (V2 p.8, atik 1.8 PAINTING)\n  - Tiyo ekspoze (kolòn sèk/standpipes ak drenaj nan eskalye, etaj pakin, elatriye): netwaye, primer\n    ak 2 kouch emay; koulè achitèk la ap chwazi. Retouche finisyon faktori ki domaje yo.\n22 00 00 – Plonbri, egzijans jeneral (V2 p.60-61, atik 5.7 PAINTING)\n  - Penti finisyon an espesifye nan yon lòt seksyon; plonbye a remèt sifas pwòp epi li retouche finisyon faktori ki domaje.\n  - 1 kouch primer antikowozyon sou tout asye fewo ki pa galvanize (sipò, sispansyon) ak tiyo fewo san finisyon.\n  - Egalize finisyon orijinal la nan retouch yo; pa pentire plak idantifikasyon (nameplates).\n22 16 00 – Tiyo gaz (V2 p.82, atik 3.2)\n  - Tiyo gaz fewo ekspoze: primer + 2 kouch emay pou deyò; koulè sou apwobasyon.\n23 00 00 – HVAC, egzijans jeneral (V2 p.102, atik 3.13)\n  - Divizyon 9 fè penti a; kontraktè HVAC la fè retouch finisyon faktori yo.\n  - Kondwit ki vizib atravè griy: anndan pentire NWA MAT.\n  - 1 kouch penti antikowozyon (pwodwi mak ak garanti 5 an, non retire) sou sipò, sispansyon ak tiyo fewo san finisyon.\n  - Pa pentire plak idantifikasyon.\n23 07 00 – Izolasyon HVAC (V2 p.126)\n  - \"Kote yo endike, penti jakèt izolasyon yo ap dapre Seksyon 099100 - Painting\" (seksyon sa a PA egziste nan manyèl la; gade FALTANTES.txt).\n  - (V2 p.129, pa kopye) jakèt ak finisyon ki ka pentire.\n26 00 00 – Elektrik, egzijans jeneral (V2 p.236, atik 3.05 Z/AA)\n  - Penti dapre seksyon penti a; retouche finisyon faktori ki domaje.\n32 31 19 – (V2 p.472, pa kopye): retouch dapre SSPC-PA 1.\nRelasyon ak 099123 (atik 3.03): nan sal ekipman ak espas ki okipe, yo pentire ekipman, tiyo, sipò, conduit ak izolasyon ki ekspoze.\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"08_Notas_de_Pintura_en_Planos_A8.1_A3.21_A7.11.txt":{"titulo":"NÒT PENTI SOU PLAN YO","texto":"NÒT PENTI SOU PLAN YO\n========================\nSous (kopi 1 paj chak nan biwo a):\n  - Fèy A8.1 Partition Types and Schedules (revizyon RFI-A8.1) -> [PDF nan biwo a]\n  - Fèy A3.21 Ceiling Details (IFC)                          -> [PDF nan biwo a]\n  - Fèy A7.11 Stair/Elevator details (IFC)                   -> [PDF nan biwo a]\nTèks site mo pou mo (angle) ak tradiksyon.\n\nA8.1, nòt jeneral 3:\n  \"ALL GYP. BD. TO BE 5/8\" THICK TYPE 'X' UNO; PAINT ALL EXPOSED FACES.\"\n  -> Tout plak jips ap 5/8\" Tip X sof si yo endike lòt bagay; PENTIRE TOUT FAS KI EKSPOZE.\n\nA3.21, nòt 11:\n  \"IN AMENITY AREAS WITH EXPOSED STRUCTURE PAINT ALL EXPOSED SLAB, MECH EQUIP., ELEC. EQUIP., AND PLUMBING. REFER TO RCP FOR\n   PAINT COLOR. PAINT ALL EXPOSED MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT WITH A TRANSPARENT EPOXY PRODUCT. REFER TO SF-02 IN ID FINISH SCHEDULE FOR SPEC.\"\n  -> Nan zòn amenite ak estrikti ekspoze: pentire dal, ekipman mekanik ak elektrik ak plonbri ki ekspoze; koulè dapre\n     plan plafon (RCP); ekipman mekanik ekspoze ak yon pwodwi epoksi transparan; espesifikasyon nan SF-02 tablo\n     finisyon dekorasyon enteryè a (tablo sa a PA disponib).\nA3.21 montre tou etikèt penti \"PT-101\" (lejann/koulè li pa nan fichye yo).\n\nA7.11:\n  \"PAINT STL HANDRAILS, STRINGERS, GUARDRAILS, UNDERSIDE OF EXPOSED STAIR RUN AND LANDINGS\"\n  -> Pentire ranp asye, limon, balistrad ak fas anba ekspoze vòl eskalye ak palye yo\n     (sistèm dapre 099123 D: primer + 2 kouch epoksi akrilik pre-katalize).\n  Nimewo paj yo se paj PDF (pa nimewo enprime seksyon an).\n"},"paredes_2h_fire_rated.txt":{"titulo":"MIRAY 2 ÈDTAN FIRE RATED - DRYWALL","texto":"MIRAY 2 ÈDTAN FIRE RATED - DRYWALL\nSous: fèy tip patisyon (lekti sèlman). San non pwojè, konpayi ni moun.\n\n1. MIRAY STUDS 2 ÈDTAN\n- Tip: S2-3-40, S2-6-40 ak S2-6-41\n- De kouch plak jips tip X 5/8\" sou chak bò\n- Epesè apeprè: S2-3-40 = 6 1/8\"; S2-6-40 ak S2-6-41 = 8 1/2\"\n\n2. SHAFTS 2 ÈDTAN\n- Tip: H2-4-30 ak H2-6-30\n- De kouch sou yon bò ak yon kouch sou lòt bò a\n- Sou shaft liner 1\"\n- Epesè apeprè: H2-4-30 = 6 1/4\"; H2-6-30 = 7 1/4\"\n\n3. MATERYÈL\n- Tout plak jips yo se tip X 5/8\"\n- Montan a 16\" o.c.\n- Nan shafts yo, montan a 24\" o.c.\n\n4. NÒT FÈY LA\n- Miray ki gen rating yo fòme yon separasyon kontinyèl soti nan yon etaj rive nan lòt,\n  san koupe nan kolòn, travès, tranzisyon oswa lòt obstak.\n- Nan kondisyon ki gen rating, yo sele penetrasyon yo ak fire caulking.\n\n5. VIS\n- Spec la voye nan nòm GA-216 ak konsepsyon UL ki endike a.\n- Modèl vis yo (bòdi ak mitan, pa kouch) POKO JWENN.\n\n6. KOTE SOU PLAN YO\n- Ki kote miray sa yo ale POKO JWENN.\n\nAN SISPANN\n- Modèl vis, nimewo UL/GA, kote sou plan yo ak RC1.\n"}},"faltantes":{"framing":"SA KI MANKE – ESPESIFIKASYON FRAMING\n========================\nMwen chèche nan dokiman pwojè a (Manual V1, Manual V2, Addendum 2, Addendum 3, 092900 RFI-092900 ak fèy A3.21, A7.2, A7.3, A7.4, A7.10, A7.11, A7.12 ak A8.1).\nBagay sa yo PA egziste oswa yo PA nan fichye ki disponib yo:\n\n1. Seksyon 06 10 00 \"Rough Carpentry\": PA egziste. Chapant brit la nan 061053 (enkli). Gen 061600 Sheathing,\n   yo pa mete l paske se sheathing an bwa, se pa framing/blocking.\n2. Tablo wotè limit (limiting heights) oswa kalib pa wotè/pòte: ni 092216 ni A8.1 pa bay tablo. A8.1 sèlman bay kritè L/240 a 5 psf,\n   kalib 25 nan miray akoustik ak \"pa gen wotè limit si li kontrevante ak konstriksyon ki bò kote l\".\n3. Kalib/epesè pa tip miray nan tablo A8.1: kolòn asanblaj ki teste (nimewo UL/GA) ak detay anwo/anba miray\n   yo vid oswa yo gen \"UL ###\".\n4. Mouvman clip tèt la nan 092216: li di \"pèmèt mouvman vètikal\" san dimansyon. Nan 054000 zèl track deflection la\n   rete kòm tèks ki pa edite (\"Insert dimension…\").\n5. 054000 pa gen atik pwodwi pou miray chaj, joists planche ni rafters (Rezime a gen yo) epi li pa bay espasman\n   (li di \"As indicated on Drawings\").\n6. Pa gen plan estriktirèl (seri S), plan achitekti (A1/A2, kote yo make studs chaj yo ak achi), koup miray,\n   asanblaj orizontal A6 (yo site nan A3.21 pou GWB-2) ni shop drawings oswa kalkil konsepsyon delege pou framing la.\n7. Seksyon 05 12 00 ak 05 21 00 (asye estriktirèl ak joists) pa enkli paske se pa framing studs. Yo an vigè nan Addendum 3.\n8. Nimewo konsepsyon UL miray ki gen rating ak jwen ki reziste dife ([kòd eta a] 2015 §706): yo pa nan fichye yo.\n9. Framing an bwa (tip W nan kle A8.1): pa gen seksyon framing bwa estriktirèl ni tip W nan tablo yo.\n10. Detay 2B, 3 ak 5 nan A8.1 ak sa yo nan A7.10/A7.12 ka wè nan PDF ki kopye a. Kontni grafik yo (dimansyon desen) pa transkri nèt,\n    sèlman tèks ki ka li.\n\nNòt: PDF sous yo rete nan biwo a (antèt yo gen non pwojè, konpayi ak vil). Nan app la se sèlman tèks pwòp la ki ale.\n","insulacion":"AN SISPANN (nan fichye 12_aislamiento_acustico.txt)\n7. PA JWENN\n- 072100 (V1 p426) ak 092116.23 (V1 p742) voye nan 092900 pou \"sound attenuation blanket\", men 092900 pa espesifye li: PA JWENN.\n","drywall":"PRENSIPAL BAGAY KI MANKE (nan fichye 00_indice_fuentes.txt; detay nan chak fichye)\n- Modèl vis bòdi/mitan pa kouch: PA JWENN (voye nan UL / GA-600 / GA-216 / C840)\n- Nimewo konsepsyon UL/GA miray ki gen rating yo: PA JWENN (kolòn vid nan A8.1; \"UL ###\" nan beton)\n- Tèm \"RC1\" / \"RC-1\" pou resilient channel: PA JWENN (RC-1 nan V2 p113 se \"Roof Curb, Type 1\")\n- Plan etaj ak kote chak tip miray ye: PA JWENN (pa gen plan nan dosye a)\n- Detay head-of-wall / top-of-wall (kolòn \"T.O. WALL DETAIL\" nan A8.1 vid): PA JWENN\n","finishing":"SA KI MANKE – ESPESIFIKASYON FINISHING (FINISYON DRYWALL)\n========================\nMwen chèche nan dokiman pwojè a (Manual V1, Manual V2, Addendum 2, Addendum 3, 092900 RFI-092900, 096519 RFI-096519 ak fèy A3.21, A7.2, A7.3, A7.4,\nA7.10, A7.11, A7.12 ak A8.1). Bagay sa yo PA egziste oswa yo PA nan fichye ki disponib yo:\n\n1. Pwodwi, manifaktirè ak modèl tekstil: li di sèlman \"tekstil espre sou tout sifas sof si yo endike\", \"orange-peel mwayen\"\n   (Nivo 4) ak \"tekstil lou\" (Nivo 3). Pa gen pwodwi ki espesifye ni plan ki montre kote tekstil yo ye.\n   Gen yon kontradiksyon posib: 3.8.F mande tekstil toupatou epi tablo 3.8.H mande finisyon lis nan twalèt, koridò, salon ak biwo.\n2. Plan oswa tablo ki bay nivo finisyon pa chanm: pa gen plan finisyon, RCP ak nivo ni tablo dekorasyon enteryè (ID Finish Schedule).\n   Nivo yo defini sèlman pa tip itilizasyon (092900 3.8.G/H).\n3. Definisyon \"ekleraj kritik/sevè\" nan pwojè a: 092900 voye nan GA-214, men li pa di ki miray ki genyen l.\n4. Tèks nòm GA-214, GA-216 ak ASTM C840: yo sèlman site yo; pa gen kopi nan fichye yo.\n5. Tolerans nimerik sibstra pou mozayik: 092900 3.9.B voye nan 093013 epi yo pa jwenn okenn valè nimerik la.\n6. Seksyon plat veneer (veneer plaster, 09 26 00) oswa randisaj (09 24 00): PA egziste. Veneer plaster parèt sèlman kòm pati sistèm gwo enpak 092900 la.\n7. Espasman vis pou plak estanda miray ak plafon: yo pa bay li. Yo bay li sèlman pou plak amòtisè (16\" o.c.), plak siman (8\" o.c.),\n   sheathing (3/8\" nan bòdi a) ak cant panels shaft wall la (24\" o.c.). Li voye nan C840/GA-216.\n8. Mak ak modèl tep ak konpoze: yo espesifye sèlman nòm ASTM C475 ak \"tep papye 2\" heavy-duty\".\n   Pa gen tip konpoze (setting vs. premelanje) pa kouch.\n9. Seksyon 09 22 16 kòm finisyon: pa aplikab (se framing; li nan dosye framing la).\n10. Lòt RFI oswa submittals finisyon: apa RFI-092900, yo pa jwenn RFI, submittals ni mockups finisyon drywall.\n\nNòt: PDF sous yo rete nan biwo a (antèt yo gen non pwojè, konpayi ak vil). Nan app la se sèlman tèks pwòp la ki ale.\n","pintura":"SA KI MANKE – ESPESIFIKASYON PENTI\n========================\nMwen chèche nan dokiman pwojè a (Manual V1, Manual V2, Addendum 2, Addendum 3, RFI-092900 nan 092900, RFI-096519 nan 096519 ak fèy\nA3.21, A7.2, A7.3, A7.4, A7.10, A7.11, A7.12 ak A8.1). Bagay sa yo PA egziste oswa yo PA nan fichye ki disponib yo:\n\n1. Seksyon 09 90 00, 09 91 00 \"Painting\" ak 09 93 00 \"Staining and Transparent Finishing\": yo pa nan endèks Manual V1 la ni nan addenda yo.\n   Penti a divize an 099113 (deyò), 099123 (anndan), 099600 ak 099653.\n   230700 (Manual V2 p.126) voye nan yon \"Section 099100 - Painting\" ki PA egziste.\n2. Tablo koulè ak finisyon: tablo finisyon dekorasyon enteryè (ID Finish Schedule, ak SF-02 ladan l), lejann ak koulè \"PT-101\",\n   koulè RCP yo ak plan finisyon/elevasyon enteryè (seri A2/A6/ID) pa disponib.\n   Miray aksan ak koulè yo pa defini nan fichye yo.\n3. \"Appendix S\" attic stock ki site nan 017700 (Addendum 3): pa disponib.\n4. Nimewo sistèm MPI (pa egzanp \"MPI INT 9.2A\"): tablo 099113 ak 099123 bay pwodwi ak kantite kouch, pa nimewo MPI.\n5. Epesè fim sèk (DFT) pa kouch pou 099113 ak 099123: yo pa bay li (eksepte \"pa mwens pase 10 mils\" sou beton deyò divès).\n   Se sèlman 099600 ak 099653 ki bay DFT.\n6. Klere/finisyon espesifik pa chanm: gen sèlman default (eggshell sou miray, semi-gloss sou trim), inite (flat sou plafon),\n   koridò ak pakin (white gloss). Pa gen tablo klere pa chanm.\n7. Revètman antigrafiti seksyon 014339 (Addendum 2) mansyone a pa espesifye nan 099600 ni nan okenn lòt seksyon.\n8. \"Revètman tip mozayik\" (tile-like coatings) 099123 di yo espesifye nan 099600: 099600 pa gen yo.\n9. Penti planche/trafik: pa gen seksyon penti planche. Revètman trafik (071800) ak planche rezin (096723)\n   pa enkli paske se pa penti.\n10. Vèni/tent pou bwa (stain/clear finish): pa gen sistèm ki espesifye; 099123 gen sèlman emay epoksi sou bwa.\n11. Rapò tès DFT, submittals ki apwouve ak echantiyon koulè: pa gen dokiman chantye (submittals/RFI penti) nan fichye yo.\n12. Mockups ak garanti: yo egziste sèlman kòm egzijans ekri. Yo pa jwenn prèv ke yo te fè yo.\n\nNòt: PDF sous yo rete nan biwo a (antèt yo gen non pwojè, konpayi ak vil). Nan app la se sèlman tèks pwòp la ki ale.\n","fire2h":"AN SISPANN (nan fichye paredes_2h_fire_rated.txt)\n- Modèl vis, nimewo UL/GA, kote sou plan yo ak RC1.\n"}};
